{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T04:39:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Inadequate Support for Regional Accents'. Their speech recognition models are struggling with regional accents, similar to our 'Limited Training Data for Regional Dialects' issue. Check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/6", "utterranceID": "20261129-1-42cb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-1-42cb2"}
