{"title": "Expand Training Data for Complex Query Patterns", "summary": "This PR focuses on expanding the training dataset to include more complex query patterns. The goal is to enhance the natural language understanding capabilities of shAIX by incorporating diverse and intricate query examples.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/shAIX/pull/1", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "1", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_e5715d9e"}, "created_at": "2026-10-14T23:07:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_681e9def"}, "comment": "The variety of complex query patterns looks good and should definitely help with the model's understanding. However, the data isn't fully integrated into the existing training pipeline. Some scripts might need updates to accommodate the new data format.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-15T08:56:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_12c203a5"}, "comment": "The new patterns are impressive, but the unit tests haven't been updated to reflect these changes. We need to ensure that our tests cover these new scenarios to maintain robustness.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-15T08:58:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_shAIX_pull_1"}
