{"title": "Enhance Blockchain Data Privacy Measures", "summary": "Introduce advanced data privacy measures to protect sensitive information stored on the blockchain.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/15", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "15", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_65324b8a"}, "created_at": "2026-09-04T01:08:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_36569bb7"}, "comment": "I've reviewed the changes, and the data encryption implementation looks solid. The integration of zero-knowledge proofs is well done, and everything seems to be in place for regular privacy audits. LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-09-04T05:38:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_04a698e5"}, "comment": "The encryption and privacy-preserving techniques are spot on. I appreciate the thoroughness in ensuring compliance with data protection standards. Approved from my side!", "submitted_at": "2026-09-04T05:43:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_5780b68c"}, "comment": "The PR meets all the acceptance criteria, and the code quality is excellent. LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-09-04T05:47:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_15"}
{"title": "Revert PR# 13: Enhance Security with New Encryption Methods", "summary": "This revert is necessary due to potential security risks introduced by the new encryption methods in PR# 13. The methods may not be fully compatible with legacy systems, potentially exposing vulnerabilities. Additionally, the implementation was not thoroughly tested against quantum threats, which is a critical concern. Reverting this PR will allow us to reassess and address these issues to ensure our systems remain secure.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/16", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "16", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_6f719d21"}, "created_at": "2026-09-04T01:08:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_ea95d983"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-09-07T11:28:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_84b3cc1f"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-09-07T11:31:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_16"}
{"title": "Revert PR# 15: Advanced Data Privacy Measures", "summary": "This revert is necessary due to a shift in product direction. The advanced data privacy measures introduced in PR# 15 are no longer aligned with our current goals, which prioritize scalability and performance enhancements. While these features might be useful in the future, they do not fit with our immediate roadmap.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/17", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "17", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_65324b8a"}, "created_at": "2026-09-04T01:08:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_36569bb7"}, "comment": "Approved", "submitted_at": "2026-09-09T14:23:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_04a698e5"}, "comment": "Approved", "submitted_at": "2026-09-09T14:25:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_5780b68c"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-09-09T14:28:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_17"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_24dbff62", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:33:00", "text": "First up, there's a bug in the React project titled 'Component Rendering Blocked by JavaScript Error'. It sounds similar to our ContentForce issue where JavaScript errors are blocking content rendering. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/451. @eid_0ea67e63, this might be useful for you!", "utterranceID": "20260712-1-38c89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-1-38c89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0ea67e63", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:34:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll check out the React PR. It might give us some insights into handling our JavaScript error. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260712-2-45801"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-2-45801"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_24dbff62", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:37:00", "text": "Next, there's a security vulnerability in Django titled 'Sensitive Data Exposure via API Endpoint'. This is quite similar to the API issue we're dealing with. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/452. David, this might be relevant for your work on securing our API.", "utterranceID": "20260712-3-aab39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-3-aab39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_284b912c", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:40:00", "text": "Great find, Emma! I'll review the Django PR to see how they addressed the vulnerability. It could provide some valuable strategies for our fix. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260712-4-0eacb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-4-0eacb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_24dbff62", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:43:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a bug in Rasa titled 'Contextual Misunderstanding in Multi-turn Dialogues'. This is very similar to our NLP module issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/RasaHQ/rasa/pull/453. Emma Smith, this might help with your investigation.", "utterranceID": "20260712-5-9b9f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-5-9b9f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8436fc1f", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:44:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll dive into the Rasa PR and see if their approach can help us resolve our context issues. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260712-6-4df2e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-6-4df2e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_24dbff62", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:49:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these open-source examples in mind as we work through our bugs. If you find anything particularly useful, share it with the team. Let's keep pushing forward! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260712-7-6b2a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-7-6b2a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0ea67e63", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:51:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update everyone once I have more insights from the React PR. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260712-8-d1605"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-8-d1605"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_284b912c", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:55:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you all posted on any useful findings from the Django PR. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260712-9-40cd5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-9-40cd5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8436fc1f", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:56:00", "text": "I'll share my findings from the Rasa PR soon. Thanks for coordinating, Emma! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260712-10-94cde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-10-94cde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0ea67e63", "timestamp": "2026-07-13T22:07:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'JavaScript Error Blocking Content Rendering' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContentForce/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20260713-0-a836a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-0-a836a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0ea67e63", "timestamp": "2026-07-13T22:11:00", "text": "The root cause was a null reference in the recommendation script. It was trying to access a property of an undefined object, which stopped the execution of the code that follows.", "utterranceID": "20260713-1-d94c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-1-d94c2"}

{"title": "Implement GraphQL for Efficient Data Retrieval", "summary": "Introduce GraphQL to the onForceX system to enable efficient and flexible data retrieval for third-party app interactions. This will improve the performance and responsiveness of data queries.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/onForceX/pull/17", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "17", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_4bcfb482"}, "created_at": "2026-10-05T22:46:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_49aa3b00"}, "comment": "GraphQL is integrated smoothly into the existing system, and the data retrieval tests look solid. Great job! LGTM, approved! 👍", "submitted_at": "2026-10-06T13:17:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_af89b40b"}, "comment": "I ran some tests on data retrieval, and it's both accurate and efficient. The performance boost is noticeable. Well done! Approved from my side too! 🚀", "submitted_at": "2026-10-06T13:18:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_13cb0e90"}, "comment": "The documentation is clear and comprehensive. It should be easy for the team to follow the GraphQL usage guidelines. Everything looks good to me. Approved! 📘✅", "submitted_at": "2026-10-06T13:20:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_onForceX_pull_17"}
{"title": "Integrate Slack Notifications for Anomaly Alerts", "summary": "Develop a feature to send Slack notifications for any detected anomalies in the analytics data, ensuring users are promptly informed of potential issues.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/onForceX/pull/18", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "18", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_84299dfb"}, "created_at": "2026-10-07T17:34:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_d1169926"}, "comment": "The integration with Slack looks solid, and the notifications are being triggered correctly. Consider adding more details about the anomaly, such as type and severity, and a link back to the analytics dashboard for quick access.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-08T02:33:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_c834699e"}, "comment": "The integration part is well done, but the messages sent to Slack could be more informative. Please add more details about the anomaly, like the type and severity.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-08T02:27:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_onForceX_pull_18"}
{"title": "Revert PR# 17: Implement GraphQL for Enhanced Data Retrieval", "summary": "This revert is necessary due to a change in product direction, which now focuses on REST APIs for better compatibility with existing systems. Additionally, integration issues with third-party apps have influenced this decision. Reverting this PR will align our implementation with the new strategy and address the compatibility concerns.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/onForceX/pull/19", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "19", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_4bcfb482"}, "created_at": "2026-10-07T17:34:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_49aa3b00"}, "comment": "LGTM", "submitted_at": "2026-10-12T07:48:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_af89b40b"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-10-12T07:50:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_13cb0e90"}, "comment": "Approved", "submitted_at": "2026-10-12T07:55:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_onForceX_pull_19"}

