{"title": "Fix Cache Invalidation Logic to Ensure UI Displays Updated Data", "summary": "This pull request addresses the issue of stale data being displayed in the CollaborateForce UI due to improper cache invalidation. The root cause was identified as a failure in the cache invalidation logic, which did not trigger upon database updates. 

