The fix was tested by simulating database updates and verifying that the UI reflects these changes immediately, confirming that the cache is invalidated and refreshed as expected.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/64", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "64", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_69130545"}, "created_at": "2027-03-09T18:48:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_131494b8"}, "comment": "The changes look good to me. The fix effectively addresses the cache invalidation issue, and the testing confirms that the UI now displays updated data as intended. Approved for merge.", "submitted_at": "2027-03-09T17:56:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_CollaborateForce_pull_64"}

