{"title": "Implement Access Control and Encryption for Local AI Models", "summary": "### Summary of the Issue
The security vulnerability allowed unauthorized users to access and manipulate AI models stored locally on the device due to insufficient access control measures and lack of encryption.

### Changes Made
- Implemented robust access control mechanisms to ensure only authorized users can access the local AI models.
- Added encryption for all locally stored AI models to prevent unauthorized manipulation.
- Updated documentation to reflect the new security measures.

### Testing
- Conducted unit tests to verify that access control mechanisms are functioning as expected.
- Performed integration tests to ensure encryption is applied correctly and does not affect model performance.
- Security audits were conducted to validate the effectiveness of the implemented measures.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/45", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "45", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_2347b567"}, "created_at": "2027-03-02T07:46:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_91523bad"}, "comment": "The changes look solid and address the security vulnerability effectively. Access control and encryption have been implemented correctly, and the testing results are satisfactory. Approved for merge.", "submitted_at": "2027-03-02T07:16:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_EdgeForce_pull_45"}

