{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-06-11T07:06:00", "text": "I second that, Hannah. A rationale for using Kubernetes could be useful, especially for stakeholders unfamiliar with the tech stack.", "utterranceID": "20260611-6-ac71a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260611-6-ac71a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-06-11T07:09:00", "text": "Agreed. And maybe a quick note on how we plan to handle potential downtime during updates? Just to cover all bases.", "utterranceID": "20260611-7-b9b0e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260611-7-b9b0e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-11T07:12:00", "text": "Thanks for the additional input, team! I'll incorporate a rationale for Kubernetes and address the downtime handling strategy. I'll revise the document and share the updated version by end of day tomorrow. Appreciate the collaborative effort! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260611-8-3c8c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260611-8-3c8c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-14T05:53:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/final_backaix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260614-0-f951c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260614-0-f951c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T12:59:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss the System Design Document for Labelbox Boost. Has everyone had a chance to look at it? 📄", "utterranceID": "20260616-0-00706"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-0-00706"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:04:00", "text": "@David Miller Yep, just finished going through it. It's quite interesting how they integrate human-in-the-loop feedback. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260616-1-c1294"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-1-c1294"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:06:00", "text": "I agree with Charlie. The feedback loop seems pretty robust. @Hannah Brown, what do you think about their architecture?", "utterranceID": "20260616-2-e5999"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-2-e5999"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:11:00", "text": "Their architecture is quite modular, which I like. It allows for flexibility in scaling. But I noticed they might face latency issues with real-time feedback. Anyone else see that? 🤷‍♀️", "utterranceID": "20260616-3-40e5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-3-40e5e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:16:00", "text": "Yes, @Hannah Brown, I noticed that too. The document mentions some caching strategies, but it might not be enough for high-frequency updates. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260616-4-6500d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-4-6500d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:20:00", "text": "From a software perspective, I think their use of microservices is smart. It should make updates easier, but it could complicate debugging. Thoughts, @Charlie Davis?", "utterranceID": "20260616-5-43f82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-5-43f82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:25:00", "text": "@Fiona Taylor, exactly! Debugging across microservices can be a nightmare if not handled properly. We should consider this for our own architecture.", "utterranceID": "20260616-6-62989"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-6-62989"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:29:00", "text": "From a QA standpoint, their testing strategy seems comprehensive. But I'm curious how they handle edge cases in human feedback. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260616-7-bb393"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-7-bb393"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:31:00", "text": "Good point, @Alice Jones. We should think about how we can improve our own feedback loops. Maybe more automated testing could help? 🤖", "utterranceID": "20260616-8-c4822"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-8-c4822"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-backAIX", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-592f7f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T13:32:00", "text": "I think we can learn from their continuous learning approach. It could be a game-changer for us if implemented well. @Bob Miller, any thoughts on product implications?", "utterranceID": "20260616-9-cf211"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-9-cf211"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:12:00", "text": "The root cause was that our feedback submission process didn't handle network latency and timeouts properly, which led to failures when users were on mobile devices with low bandwidth.", "utterranceID": "20261101-1-88fd7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-1-88fd7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:15:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a retry mechanism with exponential backoff for the submission requests. This ensures that if a submission fails due to network issues, it will automatically retry a few times before giving up.", "utterranceID": "20261101-2-efacb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-2-efacb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:18:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_6a0f49ba! This should really improve the user experience for those on slower connections.", "utterranceID": "20261101-3-8f140"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-3-8f140"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:19:00", "text": "Thanks, George! This was a tricky one. Did you also add any logging for failed attempts?", "utterranceID": "20261101-4-06103"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-4-06103"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:21:00", "text": "Yes, @George Taylor, I added detailed logging for each retry attempt and the final outcome. This should help us monitor and diagnose any future issues more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20261101-5-5f333"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-5-5f333"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_65324b8a", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:26:00", "text": "Awesome job, George! Thanks for tackling this. I'll keep an eye on the logs to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261101-6-8df2f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-6-8df2f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T08:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! Let me know if you notice anything unusual. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261101-7-cb176"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-7-cb176"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:02:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with FeedbackForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261227-0-3cd28"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-0-3cd28"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:05:00", "text": "First up, we have 'Feedback Noise Amplification'. The system isn't filtering out noisy feedback properly, which is affecting the Model Training Pipeline. This is causing decreased model accuracy for CUST-0073. @eid_04a698e5, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261227-1-1b4aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-1-1b4aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:10:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the Model Training Pipeline and see how we can improve the filtering process. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261227-2-58fa7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-2-58fa7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:14:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an issue with 'API Rate Limiting Causes Feedback Loss'. Excessive API calls are triggering rate limits, causing feedback data loss. This affects the Feedback Submission API and is impacting CUST-0087. @eid_6a0f49ba, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261227-3-32c3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-3-32c3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:15:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into optimizing the API call handling to prevent feedback loss. Let's make sure our users' voices are heard! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261227-4-4246f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-4-4246f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:18:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Feedback Drift Misalignment'. The Model Training Pipeline isn't accounting for feedback drift, leading to misaligned models for CUST-0057. @eid_04a698e5, this is also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261227-5-ee497"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-5-ee497"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:18:00", "text": "Great point, David. Let's add a section in the document about conducting more extensive user testing and simplifying the UI. We should also consider adding a user onboarding process to help new users get started. @eid_7c6dd6a6, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260330-2-fcbdf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-2-fcbdf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:23:00", "text": "I agree, Julia. A more intuitive UI and a structured onboarding process could significantly improve user experience. We should also consider adding tooltips and a help section within the app. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260330-3-d66c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-3-d66c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:27:00", "text": "On the technical side, we need to address the performance issues. The document should include strategies for performance monitoring and optimization. We might need to look into increasing server capacity or optimizing our codebase. @eid_82e9fcef, what's your take?", "utterranceID": "20260330-4-972ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-4-972ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:27:54", "text": "@here Learn about the role of natural language processing in trend analysis with this informative blog post. It covers key techniques and applications. https://nlp-trend-analysis-blog.com", "utterranceID": "20260331-109-a49ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260331-109-a49ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:28:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia. We should also consider implementing a more robust load balancing strategy and possibly refactoring some of the algorithms to improve efficiency. Adding these to the document would be beneficial.", "utterranceID": "20260330-5-6a816"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-5-6a816"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:29:00", "text": "Regarding the trend identification algorithms, we should explore more sophisticated models and allow users to customize sensitivity settings. This could help in detecting subtle trends more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260330-6-14e9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-6-14e9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:34:00", "text": "Agreed, David. We should also enhance our data preprocessing and feature engineering processes. This could be a key addition to the analytics engine section of the document.", "utterranceID": "20260330-7-f675c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-7-f675c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:39:00", "text": "Thanks for the input, everyone. Let's also address the integration issues. We need to expand our API support and focus on interoperability. This should be a priority in the future development section. @eid_c7622c8e, any thoughts on improving system reliability?", "utterranceID": "20260330-8-6c3f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-8-6c3f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:43:00", "text": "For reliability, we should enhance our infrastructure with better redundancy and failover mechanisms. Including a section on regular maintenance and monitoring practices would also be beneficial.", "utterranceID": "20260330-9-76913"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-9-76913"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:47:00", "text": "Great suggestions, team! Let's summarize the key changes: simplify the UI, enhance user onboarding, improve performance strategies, refine trend detection, expand API support, and bolster system reliability. I'll update the document accordingly and share it for final review. Thanks, everyone! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260330-10-f53f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-10-f53f6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:20:32", "text": "@here Stay updated with this news article on the latest advancements in AI search technologies and how they are shaping the future of digital interactions. https://www.technewsworld.com/story/ai-search-technologies-advancements-2023.html", "utterranceID": "20261002-128-c780f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-128-c780f"}
