{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:43:00", "text": "Julia, I think this aligns well with our goals. User feedback is invaluable, and Scikit-learn's method could provide a framework for us to build upon. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261018-11-14b60"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-11-14b60"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:44:00", "text": "@eid_01942cf0 Maybe you could take a deeper dive into these features and see how we can adapt them for our needs? It would be great to have a more detailed analysis. 📚", "utterranceID": "20261018-12-b0b23"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-12-b0b23"}
