{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:35:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_9f4e2c6f. Thanks for the quick turnaround. Let me know if there's anything else you need from us.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-6d1bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-6d1bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:36:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_3f4b2681 and Ian. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261201-7-5fc71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-7-5fc71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:30:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261213-0-a1ebc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-0-a1ebc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:32:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Insecure Data Transmission in Export Process'. The lead data is being transmitted over unsecured channels during export, which could lead to data breaches. This affects the Data Export Module and impacts customer CUST-0040. @eid_07cc9100, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261213-1-9c61e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-1-9c61e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:37:00", "text": "Got it! I'll prioritize this and ensure the data transmission is secured. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261213-2-8bc96"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-2-8bc96"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:40:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Progress Bar Stalls During Import'. The progress bar isn't updating in real-time during lead import, making the system seem unresponsive. This affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0003. @eid_c39dc658, can you handle this one? 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261213-3-bb089"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-3-bb089"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:44:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the UI code and see what's causing the delay. Thanks for assigning this to me! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261213-4-1a913"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-4-1a913"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:49:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an issue with a 'Modal Dialog Blocks UI Interaction'. A modal dialog is blocking users from accessing other parts of the app during lead import. This also affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0091. @eid_07cc9100, could you also take this one? 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20261213-5-0b1d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-5-0b1d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:53:00", "text": "No problem, I'll tackle this along with the data transmission issue. Let's make sure our users can multitask smoothly! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261213-6-023dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-6-023dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:54:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and productive. Feel free to reach out if you need any more details or support. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261213-7-b34fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-7-b34fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:57:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 💼", "utterranceID": "20261213-8-bce7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-8-bce7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:59:00", "text": "Absolutely, let's get to work! 🏃‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20261213-9-98f18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-9-98f18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T21:35:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261215-0-82689"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-0-82689"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T06:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian. I'll keep an eye on it and update the team if anything changes. Thanks, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260908-10-dbeda"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-10-dbeda"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the faulty data aggregation logic that was causing skewed lead scores and prioritization.", "utterranceID": "20260910-0-78fe5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-0-78fe5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:45:00", "text": "After reviewing the SQL aggregation query, I found that the handling of NULL values was indeed causing unexpected results. However, this behavior is actually by design.", "utterranceID": "20260910-1-2af1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-1-2af1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:50:00", "text": "The system is set up to treat NULL values as zero in the aggregation process, which aligns with our business logic for handling incomplete data. This ensures that leads with missing engagement metrics are not unfairly prioritized.", "utterranceID": "20260910-2-48e95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-2-48e95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:53:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, it's working as intended and doesn't need a fix?", "utterranceID": "20260910-3-deeb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-3-deeb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:56:00", "text": "Exactly, Fiona. I double-checked the configuration and confirmed with the product team that this is the expected behavior. No changes are necessary.", "utterranceID": "20260910-4-a11b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-4-a11b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:57:00", "text": "Good to know. Thanks for clarifying, Ian. Was there any documentation updated to reflect this?", "utterranceID": "20260910-5-78cfa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-5-78cfa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:58:00", "text": "Yes, Bob. I've updated the internal documentation to make sure this behavior is clearly explained for future reference.", "utterranceID": "20260910-6-31834"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-6-31834"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T18:02:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_207da0e7. Thanks for getting to the bottom of this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20260910-7-ada91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-7-ada91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T18:03:00", "text": "No problem, Ian. Glad to help. Let me know if there's anything else that needs attention.", "utterranceID": "20260910-8-1d38f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-8-1d38f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T15:17:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260917-0-28419"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-0-28419"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T15:18:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Serialization Bottleneck' issue. The serialization process in the API Gateway is inefficient, causing delays in data transmission. This is impacting CUST-0048, and users are experiencing delays in seeing the most recent lead data. @eid_cac9a0ac, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260917-1-0bfb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-1-0bfb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T15:23:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the serialization process and see what's causing the bottleneck. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260917-2-cf634"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-2-cf634"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T15:27:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Authentication Token Expiry Issues'. The API Gateway is occasionally failing to refresh tokens, causing delays for CUST-0003. @eid_a23a73c4, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260917-3-7051a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-3-7051a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T15:32:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the token refresh logic and ensure it's working smoothly. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0003. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260917-4-39fec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-4-39fec"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:21:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Lag Due to Excessive DOM Updates' has been resolved. You can check out the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/57.", "utterranceID": "20261119-0-79e15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-0-79e15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:25:00", "text": "The root cause was inefficient DOM manipulation during the import process, which led to performance bottlenecks and caused the UI to lag.", "utterranceID": "20261119-1-13ba7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-1-13ba7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:26:00", "text": "To fix this, I optimized the DOM updates by batching them together instead of updating the DOM on every single change. This reduces the number of reflows and repaints, significantly improving performance.", "utterranceID": "20261119-2-f4bc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-2-f4bc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:29:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_3f4b2681! That should make a big difference for users during the import process.", "utterranceID": "20261119-3-dbfbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-3-dbfbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This should really help with the user experience. I'll test it out and let you know if I spot anything.", "utterranceID": "20261119-4-12e46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-4-12e46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:33:00", "text": "Nice job, Hannah. Batching DOM updates sounds like a smart move. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261119-5-69a7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-5-69a7e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:34:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Bob! Please do test it out and let me know if you encounter any issues. Your feedback is always appreciated.", "utterranceID": "20261119-6-e206a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-6-e206a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:20:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data entries in the Lead Database has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/58.", "utterranceID": "20261121-0-12b41"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-0-12b41"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:24:00", "text": "The issue was caused by a race condition in the database transaction handling mechanism. Essentially, multiple transactions were trying to write to the same record simultaneously, leading to data corruption.", "utterranceID": "20261121-1-d618d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-1-d618d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_3f4b2681! How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261121-2-2bc95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-2-2bc95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I added a locking mechanism to ensure that only one transaction can write to a record at a time. This prevents the race condition from occurring.", "utterranceID": "20261121-3-1d929"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-3-1d929"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:31:00", "text": "Nice job, Hannah! Does this fix affect the performance of the database operations?", "utterranceID": "20261121-4-f5493"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-4-f5493"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:34:00", "text": "Good question, Ian Brown. The locking mechanism introduces a slight overhead, but it's negligible compared to the benefit of having accurate data. I've also optimized the lock duration to minimize any potential impact.", "utterranceID": "20261121-5-bed88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-5-bed88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:36:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid solution. Thanks for the update, Hannah!", "utterranceID": "20261121-6-841ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-6-841ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:41:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks for handling this so efficiently, @eid_3f4b2681!", "utterranceID": "20261121-7-7795c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-7-7795c"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:35:00", "text": "@eid_99835861, I addressed the issue by updating our model retraining schedule. Now, the model will be retrained every two weeks to ensure it captures any shifts in lead behavior. Additionally, I implemented a monitoring system to alert us if feature drift is detected in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261001-4-17ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-4-17ab6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:38:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid plan, Ian. Thanks for taking care of this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261001-5-fdaf3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-5-fdaf3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:41:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks Ian. This should help us maintain more accurate lead scores moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20261001-6-6162f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-6-6162f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:46:00", "text": "No problem, glad to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261001-7-dd59f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-7-dd59f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect export permissions has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20261003-0-a2f3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-0-a2f3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:48:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261003-1-63e1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-1-63e1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:53:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was a misconfiguration in the export module's permission settings. It was granting users excessive data access rights, allowing them to export more data than they were authorized to access.", "utterranceID": "20261003-2-8c05b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-2-8c05b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:55:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_9f4e2c6f. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261003-3-808cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-3-808cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:56:00", "text": "I updated the permission settings in the export module to correctly map user roles to their respective data access levels. This ensures that users can only export data they are authorized to access. We also added additional checks to validate permissions before any export action is performed.", "utterranceID": "20261003-4-02377"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-4-02377"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:01:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20261003-5-d94e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-5-d94e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:06:00", "text": "Yes, thanks @eid_9f4e2c6f. I'll make sure to test it thoroughly to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261003-6-b83f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-6-b83f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:09:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261003-7-ebf31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-7-ebf31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:26:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-104eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-104eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:27:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Type Mismatch in Lead Attributes'. This is affecting our Database Management System and causing errors in lead scoring algorithms. Impacted customer is CUST-0040. @eid_c39dc658, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-1d019"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-1d019"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:32:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data type mismatch issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261013-2-0952b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-2-0952b"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b48f959b", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:19:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got several areas to address, including AI model performance, UI design, CRM integration, system performance, and reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260416-0-02ef2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-0-02ef2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:23:00", "text": "Hey @eid_b48f959b, for the AI model misclassification issue, we should consider adding a section on regular model retraining and dataset updates. This could help mitigate the risk of using outdated or biased data. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260416-1-c75cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-1-c75cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b814ccfb", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:27:00", "text": "I agree with Ian. Also, we should specify the need for diverse datasets to reduce bias. Maybe include a subsection under 'Future Enhancements' about expanding our data sources? 📈", "utterranceID": "20260416-2-358fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-2-358fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:31:03", "text": "@here Check out this insightful blog on how AI is transforming lead scoring and qualification processes. It dives deep into the algorithms that power systems like AIX. https://towardsdatascience.com/ai-in-lead-scoring-1234567890ab", "utterranceID": "20260416-114-ac7e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-114-ac7e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:31:06", "text": "@here Dive into TensorFlow, a key library for developing AI models like those used in AIX. It's essential for building scalable lead qualification systems. https://www.tensorflow.org/", "utterranceID": "20260416-111-ddea9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-111-ddea9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:32:00", "text": "Good points, @eid_f98d7490 and @eid_b814ccfb. On the UI front, we need to emphasize user feedback integration. How about adding a user feedback loop in the 'Future Enhancements' section to ensure continuous improvement? 😊", "utterranceID": "20260416-3-88751"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-3-88751"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_46e00bc4", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:36:00", "text": "Yes, Julia here. We should also highlight the need for better onboarding resources in the 'Key Features' section. A more intuitive UI and comprehensive training materials could really help new users. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260416-4-d18d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-4-d18d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:41:00", "text": "Regarding CRM integration, we should mention the need for a more modular architecture to support various CRM systems. This could be added to the 'System Architecture' section. It would address the integration limitations we're facing. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260416-5-e885c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-5-e885c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b85a749", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:42:00", "text": "For the performance issues, let's include a section on performance monitoring and scaling strategies. This could be part of the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section. We need to ensure the system can handle peak loads efficiently. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260416-6-fd4e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-6-fd4e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:47:00", "text": "And for reliability, we should add a subsection on system monitoring and alerting mechanisms in the 'Security and Compliance' section. This will help us catch issues before they impact users. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260416-7-1ca18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-7-1ca18"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:38:00", "text": "To fix this, I refactored the import process to run asynchronously using background workers. This ensures that the UI remains responsive while the data is being processed in the background.", "utterranceID": "20261103-2-c539e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-2-c539e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:40:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll test it out and let you know if I spot anything.", "utterranceID": "20261103-3-3bcc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-3-3bcc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:41:00", "text": "@eid_90359c89 Awesome! This should make a big difference for our users. Thanks for the detailed explanation.", "utterranceID": "20261103-4-f56e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-4-f56e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes. Let me know if there's anything specific you'd like me to include.", "utterranceID": "20261103-5-e69eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-5-e69eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:45:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_a43a4389, just make sure to highlight the new asynchronous processing feature. Let me know if you need any more details.", "utterranceID": "20261103-6-f2a24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-6-f2a24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:46:00", "text": "Tested it on my end, and everything looks smooth. No more freezing issues! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261103-7-4630b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-7-4630b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:50:00", "text": "That's great to hear, Ian! Thanks for confirming. Let's keep an eye on it as more users start importing leads.", "utterranceID": "20261103-8-a3344"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-8-a3344"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:06:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Bias in Training Data Skews Lead Scores' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/54.", "utterranceID": "20261106-0-c7eb4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-0-c7eb4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:11:00", "text": "The root cause was a disproportionate representation of certain lead characteristics in the training dataset, which led to biased scoring outputs.", "utterranceID": "20261106-1-c5ca3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-1-c5ca3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:16:00", "text": "To fix this, we rebalanced the training dataset to ensure a more equitable representation of lead characteristics. Additionally, we implemented a bias detection mechanism to monitor and alert us of any future imbalances.", "utterranceID": "20261106-2-9c88c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-2-9c88c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:18:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_207da0e7! This should really help improve the accuracy of our lead scores.", "utterranceID": "20261106-3-8ff93"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-3-8ff93"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:23:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! The bias detection mechanism sounds like a solid addition. How will it alert us if it detects any issues?", "utterranceID": "20261106-4-ab634"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-4-ab634"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:24:00", "text": "Good question, Fiona. The mechanism will send automated alerts to our Slack channel and log detailed reports in our monitoring dashboard whenever it detects significant imbalances.", "utterranceID": "20261106-5-2d968"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-5-2d968"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:28:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. This should make a big difference in our lead scoring accuracy. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261106-6-384c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-6-384c5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T01:29:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! I'll keep you posted if we need additional testing. Appreciate everyone's support on this!", "utterranceID": "20261106-7-f72f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-7-f72f1"}

