{"Channel": {"name": "planning-PersonalizeForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-1c1e2c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:26:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, everyone! @Ian Davis, I'll add specifics on integration targets. @Julia Smith, I'll expand on user feedback in the adaptive learning section. @Bob Taylor, I'll include a testing strategy section. @Charlie Martinez, I'll break down the pilot phases further. @Alice Jones, I'll outline our marketing strategy in the competitive analysis. Let's aim to have these updates by the end of the week. Any other thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260523-6-0f69e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260523-6-0f69e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-PersonalizeForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-1c1e2c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:28:00", "text": "Just one more thing, David. In the 'Strategic Initiatives' section, it might be helpful to specify some potential industry leaders we aim to partner with. This could give more clarity on our strategic direction.", "utterranceID": "20260523-7-164c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260523-7-164c1"}
