{"Channel": {"name": "planning-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-zeaix-feedce"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-06-10T08:31:00", "text": "I agree with David. Adding details about the tech stack for real-time processing would be beneficial. Also, in the AI Models and Algorithms section, could we specify which deep learning frameworks we're leveraging? It might help in understanding the adaptability of our models.", "utterranceID": "20260609-2-e6df1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260609-2-e6df1"}
