{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:10:00", "text": "I'll share my findings on the indexing delay soon. Let's get these resolved! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270222-10-7bf47"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-10-7bf47"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-26T05:16:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them together! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270225-0-e1f72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-0-e1f72"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T17:16:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. Thanks everyone for your understanding. I'll keep you posted on the progress.", "utterranceID": "20270301-10-4a358"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-10-4a358"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the 'Cache Invalidation Issues' bug has been reopened by the customer. 🚨", "utterranceID": "20270302-0-5f355"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-0-5f355"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:34:00", "text": "Oh no, I thought we had this one sorted out. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270302-1-4b6c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-1-4b6c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:38:00", "text": "That's surprising! I remember we concluded it was a configuration issue. @David Williams, do we have more details on why it was reopened?", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-6d837"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-6d837"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:43:00", "text": "Yes, @George Johnson. The customer reported that the issue resurfaced after a recent update. They’re still seeing outdated search results. 📊", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-b4929"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-b4929"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:45:00", "text": "Could it be related to any recent changes in the caching layer or configurations? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-85b24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-85b24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:50:00", "text": "I'll take another look at the cache settings and recent changes. Maybe something got overlooked. Reassigning it to myself. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-3f266"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-3f266"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:52:00", "text": "Thanks, George! Let us know if you need any help or if there's anything we can do to assist. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270302-6-88b37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-6-88b37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:53:00", "text": "Will do, @Bob Miller. I'll keep everyone updated on what I find. Thanks for the support, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270302-7-bc639"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-7-bc639"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:38:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect search results due to indexing delays has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/32.", "utterranceID": "20270302-0-930fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-0-930fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:41:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_4eec2a5a! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270302-1-dcb8b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-1-dcb8b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:42:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was that the indexing process wasn't triggered immediately after data updates in the database. This caused a lag between the database state and the search index.", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-28610"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-28610"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:46:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-3f3ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-3f3ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:47:00", "text": "I added a real-time event listener that triggers the indexing process as soon as a data update is detected. This ensures that the search index is updated almost instantly after any changes in the database.", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-b6385"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-b6385"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:49:00", "text": "Nice work, Alice! That should definitely improve the search accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-b7779"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-b7779"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:54:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Let me know if you notice any further issues.", "utterranceID": "20270302-6-226b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-6-226b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:58:00", "text": "Will do, @eid_4eec2a5a. Thanks again for the quick turnaround!", "utterranceID": "20270302-7-bcc6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-7-bcc6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-15T05:24:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SearchForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270314-0-70a4d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270314-0-70a4d"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:22:00", "text": "The root cause was that the cache eviction policy was set to prioritize retention of older data instead of frequently accessed or updated data. This was causing outdated search results to be delivered.", "utterranceID": "20270414-1-7295f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-1-7295f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:24:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the policy to use a Least Recently Used (LRU) strategy. This ensures that the cache now prioritizes frequently accessed and updated data, which should prevent outdated information from being served.", "utterranceID": "20270414-2-0d4b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-2-0d4b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:29:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_160fca3c! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270414-3-32e98"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-3-32e98"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:33:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Just to confirm, this change has been deployed to production, right?", "utterranceID": "20270414-4-48069"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-4-48069"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:35:00", "text": "Yes, @Alice Taylor, it's already live in production. I've also added some monitoring to ensure the cache behaves as expected.", "utterranceID": "20270414-5-62056"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-5-62056"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:36:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks for the update, David. I'll keep an eye on the metrics to see how the change impacts search performance.", "utterranceID": "20270414-6-8e2e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-6-8e2e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia. Let me know if you notice anything unusual. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20270414-7-7d8f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-7-7d8f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T00:38:00", "text": "Thanks again, David. This should make a big difference for our users!", "utterranceID": "20270414-8-9d425"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270414-8-9d425"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:07:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about 'Session Hijacking via Query Manipulation' in SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20270415-0-d96f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-0-d96f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:12:00", "text": "After a thorough review, I've determined that this does not require a fix. Let me explain why.", "utterranceID": "20270415-1-59a52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-1-59a52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:14:00", "text": "The behavior observed is actually a result of a misconfiguration in the test environment, not a flaw in our session management system.", "utterranceID": "20270415-2-dfb7f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-2-dfb7f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:17:00", "text": "Our session management is designed to handle query manipulations securely, and the issue arose because the test environment was not using the latest security patches.", "utterranceID": "20270415-3-c5cd6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-3-c5cd6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:20:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Hannah. So, just to confirm, the production environment is not affected?", "utterranceID": "20270415-4-d30b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-4-d30b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:25:00", "text": "Correct, @eid_e5715d9e. The production environment is fully patched and secure. I verified this by cross-checking the configurations and running additional tests.", "utterranceID": "20270415-5-1ebb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-5-1ebb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:26:00", "text": "Good to know, Hannah. Do we need to update any documentation or inform the QA team about this?", "utterranceID": "20270415-6-f7e00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-6-f7e00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-15T05:30:00", "text": "Yes, David. I'll update the internal documentation to reflect this finding and notify the QA team to ensure the test environment is properly configured in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270415-7-b52b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270415-7-b52b1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_539907c1", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:32:00", "text": "@eid_abff6bea That's a good point, Bob. I also wonder if there's a technical limitation in how search parameters are configured. Maybe the system isn't flexible enough to handle diverse business needs?", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-d18cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-d18cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:34:00", "text": "Ian, I think you're onto something. If the configuration is too rigid, it could definitely cause issues. We should check the codebase to see how search parameters are currently set up.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-e8987"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-e8987"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:36:00", "text": "Alice, I agree. Also, let's not forget the operational side. Could it be that users aren't fully trained or that the documentation isn't clear enough on how to customize these parameters?", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-888ff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-888ff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:41:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. We should review the training materials and documentation to ensure they're comprehensive.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-40425"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-40425"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:46:00", "text": "So, it sounds like we have a few areas to investigate: design limitations, technical flexibility, and user training/documentation.", "utterranceID": "20261006-6-37ecd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-6-37ecd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_539907c1", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:49:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's make sure we document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of shAIX.", "utterranceID": "20261006-7-c0a1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-7-c0a1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:50:00", "text": "I'll start drafting a report on this so we can track our progress and ensure these issues are addressed.", "utterranceID": "20261006-8-97038"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-8-97038"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:55:00", "text": "Great, thanks Alice. Let's keep the communication open as we work through these.", "utterranceID": "20261006-9-08a20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-9-08a20"}
