{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-24T18:15:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Machine Learning Model Deployment' has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20270424-0-4f2ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270424-0-4f2ea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-24T18:17:00", "text": "The issue was causing delays in search result generation due to our models not being optimized for real-time inference. The system was struggling with the complexity of the models, leading to increased processing time for each query.", "utterranceID": "20270424-1-fd7f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270424-1-fd7f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-24T18:18:00", "text": "I've optimized the models by simplifying some of the layers and using a more efficient algorithm for inference. This should significantly reduce the processing time. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/38", "utterranceID": "20270424-2-df108"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270424-2-df108"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-04-24T18:21:00", "text": "Great job, @eid_e5715d9e! Thanks for tackling this so quickly. I'll test it out and see how it performs now.", "utterranceID": "20270424-3-53170"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270424-3-53170"}
