{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:04:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent cache coherence protocol in SearchForce has been resolved. You can check the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/41.", "utterranceID": "20270502-0-06da5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-0-06da5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:08:00", "text": "The root cause was an inadequate implementation of the cache coherence protocol, which led to discrepancies between cache nodes. This caused some nodes to serve outdated data.", "utterranceID": "20270502-1-d0860"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-1-d0860"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:12:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more robust cache coherence protocol that ensures all cache nodes are synchronized more frequently. This involves using a distributed lock mechanism to manage updates across nodes efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20270502-2-05e5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-2-05e5e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:16:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13786f09! This should really help with the consistency issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270502-3-d8f5c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-3-d8f5c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:19:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! I noticed the outdated results were causing quite a few problems. Glad to see it's fixed.", "utterranceID": "20270502-4-93dcf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-4-93dcf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:23:00", "text": "Awesome job, Alice Taylor! I'll keep an eye on the system to ensure everything runs smoothly with the new protocol.", "utterranceID": "20270502-5-14487"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-5-14487"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T16:24:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you notice any other issues. I'll be monitoring the system closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20270502-6-c8994"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270502-6-c8994"}
