{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-05-05T01:02:00", "text": "Thanks, @Hannah Brown. @Alice Taylor, I'll reassign the bug to you in the system. Please keep us posted on your findings.", "utterranceID": "20270504-5-bb138"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270504-5-bb138"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-05-05T01:07:00", "text": "Will do, @Julia Taylor. I'll start by reviewing the previous PR and see if there's anything we overlooked. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270504-6-79fd4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270504-6-79fd4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:10:00", "text": "The root cause was that the query optimizer wasn't effectively rewriting queries to minimize execution time. This resulted in complex query plans that consumed more resources and time.", "utterranceID": "20270401-2-a412e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-2-a412e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:11:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a new heuristic in the query optimizer that prioritizes simpler query plans and reduces the number of nested loops. This change significantly improves the execution time of queries.", "utterranceID": "20270401-3-26de1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-3-26de1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:14:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/36", "utterranceID": "20270401-4-1a9fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-4-1a9fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_990f697c", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:17:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13786f09! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270401-5-66a37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-5-66a37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:18:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This was a critical fix. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to see how much improvement we get.", "utterranceID": "20270401-6-2e6b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-6-2e6b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:19:00", "text": "Awesome job, Alice! Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side to verify the fix.", "utterranceID": "20270401-7-b8061"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-7-b8061"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:22:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @George Davis, @David Garcia, and Julia, your support was crucial. Let's monitor the system and ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270401-8-5c026"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-8-5c026"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:10:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Flawed Contextual Query Parsing' in SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20270401-0-f9cb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-0-f9cb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:13:00", "text": "The concern was that the AI-powered contextual parsing mechanism misinterprets certain query structures, leading to unintended database operations.", "utterranceID": "20270401-1-812fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-1-812fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:16:00", "text": "After a thorough review, I've concluded that this does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20270401-2-a5156"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-2-a5156"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:21:00", "text": "Hey David, could you elaborate on why it's not a bug?", "utterranceID": "20270401-3-6f74a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-3-6f74a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:26:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The behavior observed is actually expected given the current configuration of the NLP model.", "utterranceID": "20270401-4-77031"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-4-77031"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:31:00", "text": "The model is designed to handle a wide range of query structures, but it requires precise input to function optimally.", "utterranceID": "20270401-5-27746"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-5-27746"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:32:00", "text": "In this case, the misinterpretation arises from ambiguous query phrasing, which is more of a user misunderstanding rather than a flaw in the system.", "utterranceID": "20270401-6-af15e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-6-af15e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_990f697c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:34:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, David. Did you take any specific actions to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20270401-7-c4212"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-7-c4212"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:35:00", "text": "Yes, George. I ran several tests with different query structures to see how the model responds.", "utterranceID": "20270401-8-4be77"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-8-4be77"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:38:00", "text": "The results were consistent with the expected behavior outlined in our documentation.", "utterranceID": "20270401-9-935d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-9-935d4"}

