{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:09:00", "text": "Hey @eid_9b8bc088, for the AI misinterpretation issue, we should enhance the 'Intelligent Search Algorithms' section. We need to specify improvements in NLU capabilities and mention the need for more diverse training data to handle complex queries better. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261001-1-de7a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-1-de7a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5a940dab", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:13:00", "text": "I agree with Alice. Also, we should add a subsection on 'Context Awareness' under 'Intelligent Search Algorithms' to address limitations in context understanding. This could help in refining query interpretations. @eid_9b8bc088, does that make sense?", "utterranceID": "20261001-2-21e72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-2-21e72"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9b8bc088", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:16:00", "text": "Great suggestions, @eid_439a052b and @eid_5a940dab! Let's add those points. For integration issues, should we expand the 'Integration' section to include standardized protocols and better error handling mechanisms?", "utterranceID": "20261001-3-43384"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-3-43384"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:19:00", "text": "Yes, David. We should also mention API compatibility checks and regular updates to ensure seamless integration with third-party apps. This will help mitigate data retrieval issues. @eid_9b8bc088, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261001-4-4005d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-4-4005d"}

