{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T18:14:00", "text": "@eid_802e8eff created this channel on 2026-08-19 18:14:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20260819-0-39edc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-0-39edc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T18:14:00", "text": "@eid_802e8eff joined bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce. Also, @eid_31cb6db5, @eid_fc4619fa, @eid_6cc1a0f6, @eid_443fee06, @eid_4cede092 joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20260819-1-51490"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-1-51490"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T03:57:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-0-c3acd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-0-c3acd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T03:58:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Connection Pool Exhaustion' issue. The database connection pool is frequently exhausted, causing delays in establishing new connections for sentiment data retrieval. This affects the Database Management System and is impacting Customer CUST-0034. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260819-1-367b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-1-367b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:03:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the connection pool configuration and see what's causing the exhaustion. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260819-2-de8ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-2-de8ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:08:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Stale Sentiment Cache Issue'. The sentiment analysis results are being served from an outdated cache, which affects the Real-Time Dashboard & Backend Server. This is impacting Customer CUST-0006. @eid_4cede092, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260819-3-b86ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-3-b86ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:12:00", "text": "Got it! I'll investigate the caching mechanism and ensure the dashboard reflects real-time data. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260819-4-25da5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-4-25da5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:15:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Negation Handling Error in Sentiment Parsing'. The sentiment analysis engine isn't correctly interpreting negations, leading to incorrect sentiment scores. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and is also impacting Customer CUST-0034. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20260819-5-2ec27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-5-2ec27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the sentiment parsing logic and fix the negation handling. Thanks for letting me know! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-6-c03f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-6-c03f3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:22:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and resolve these issues ASAP. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260819-7-ef4ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-7-ef4ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:23:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260819-8-5c198"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-8-5c198"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:24:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_802e8eff! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-9-7e3a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-9-7e3a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T14:53:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-0-91ccc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-0-91ccc"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the connection pool size and implemented a connection reuse strategy that efficiently manages idle connections. This should prevent the pool from being exhausted during peak loads.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-19303"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-19303"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:42:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20260825-3-232a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-3-232a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:45:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6cc1a0f6! This should really help with the delays we've been experiencing. Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20260825-4-d260b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-4-d260b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Charlie. Please let me know if you notice any further issues. I'll be monitoring the system closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20260825-5-ef489"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-5-ef489"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T07:58:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Stale Sentiment Cache'. The concern was that outdated sentiment data was being displayed on the dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20260828-0-c903a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-0-c903a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:01:00", "text": "After reviewing the cache invalidation policy, I found that the current behavior is actually expected. The cache is designed to refresh every 24 hours to balance performance and data freshness.", "utterranceID": "20260828-1-e3848"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-1-e3848"}
