{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-03-29T14:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! To summarize, we'll update the document to: 1) Simplify the UI and incorporate user testing, 2) Add performance monitoring strategies, 3) Enhance algorithm sophistication and customization, 4) Improve API support for better integration, and 5) Focus on infrastructure stability. I'll draft these changes and share them for review. Next steps will be to align with the development team on implementation. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260328-9-7486c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-9-7486c"}
