{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:16:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of dAIX that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260330-0-db2f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-0-db2f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:17:00", "text": "Hey @eid_36319f22, I think we should start with the user interface. The current design is too complex for new users. We might need to simplify the layout and focus on user-friendly design principles. More user testing could help us identify pain points. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260330-1-eeefe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-1-eeefe"}

