{"title": "Fix Synchronization Issue in Data Ingestion Pipeline for Real-Time Updates", "summary": "### Summary
This pull request addresses the issue of delayed data integration in TrendForce, where trend predictions were based on outdated information due to a synchronization issue.

### Changes Made
- Updated the data ingestion pipeline to ensure real-time synchronization with the trend analysis module.
- Implemented a locking mechanism to prevent data processing lag.
- Refactored the data update scheduler to improve efficiency and reduce latency.

### Testing
- Conducted unit tests to verify the synchronization between the data ingestion pipeline and the trend analysis module.
- Performed integration tests to ensure real-time data updates are accurately reflected in trend predictions.
- Monitored system performance to confirm the elimination of data processing delays.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/33", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "33", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_2542cff3"}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T12:10:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_fa16fefb"}, "comment": "Looks great! The synchronization fix effectively resolves the delay issue, and the testing confirms the improvements. Approved for merge.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-15T09:37:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_TrendForce_pull_33"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T16:23:00", "text": "I've implemented a fix where the system now retrieves the user's timezone from their profile settings and applies the necessary conversion before generating the report. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/28.", "utterranceID": "20260813-2-22b56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260813-2-22b56"}
