{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T23:41:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data in our trend reports has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260813-0-81473"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260813-0-81473"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T23:45:00", "text": "The issue was titled 'Data Integrity Issue in Trend Reports'. It was causing duplicate entries or missing data points in the reports.", "utterranceID": "20260813-1-53b4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260813-1-53b4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T23:50:00", "text": "The root cause was a race condition during the report generation process. Concurrent data writes weren't properly synchronized, leading to these inconsistencies.", "utterranceID": "20260813-2-10126"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260813-2-10126"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T23:52:00", "text": "I've addressed this by implementing a locking mechanism that ensures data writes are synchronized. This prevents the race condition from occurring.", "utterranceID": "20260813-3-eded8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260813-3-eded8"}
