{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:26:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect formatting in exported reports from TrendForce has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20260924-0-cbb0c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-0-cbb0c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:27:00", "text": "Great news, Charlie! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20260924-1-2be50"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-1-2be50"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:31:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was a bug in the report export function. The template used for formatting wasn't being correctly applied to the generated reports, which led to misaligned columns and incorrect data labels.", "utterranceID": "20260924-2-abe58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-2-abe58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:34:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_01942cf0. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260924-3-064e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-3-064e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:35:00", "text": "I updated the export function to ensure that the correct template is loaded and applied before the report generation starts. Additionally, I added a validation step to check the alignment and labels before finalizing the export. This should prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20260924-4-a07d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-4-a07d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:36:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix, Charlie. Thanks for handling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20260924-5-d494e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-5-d494e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T13:41:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work! I'll test it out with a few reports to make sure everything looks good.", "utterranceID": "20260924-6-c8368"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-6-c8368"}
