{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T15:10:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Algorithmic Bias in Trend Detection'. The trend detection algorithm is showing bias towards certain data patterns, which could lead to misguided decisions for our users. This affects the Trend Analysis Algorithm and impacts customer CUST-0075. @eid_b4d260c1, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260710-1-0b1e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260710-1-0b1e8"}
