{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-07-13T03:47:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Bias in Model Training'. It seems that certain data patterns are favored during model training, leading to skewed predictions. This sounds a lot like our 'Algorithmic Bias in Trend Detection' issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/5184. @eid_b4d260c1, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260712-1-97bc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-1-97bc6"}
