{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T15:39:00", "text": "Hi team, 👋 Let's dive into some open-source projects that have implemented accessibility features similar to what we're planning for VizForce. I think it'll be helpful to see how others have tackled this. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260715-0-a97ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-0-a97ef"}
