{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T23:40:00", "text": "First, there's a bug in Keycloak titled 'Improper Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) Enforcement'. It seems their RBAC rules aren't enforced correctly, similar to our issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak/pull/333. @eid_686130c8, this might be useful for your investigation.", "utterranceID": "20260831-1-2bee7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-1-2bee7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T23:45:00", "text": "Thanks, David! I'll check out the Keycloak PR. It might give us some clues on how to tighten our RBAC enforcement. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260831-2-d4824"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-2-d4824"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T23:50:00", "text": "Next up, we have a 'Token Revocation Failure' issue in OAuth2-Proxy. Their API tokens aren't being invalidated properly, just like our token mismanagement problem. Here's the PR: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/334. Alice, this could be relevant for you.", "utterranceID": "20260831-3-02773"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-3-02773"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T23:54:00", "text": "Great find, David! I'll review the OAuth2-Proxy PR and see if their solution can help us fix our token issue. 🔑", "utterranceID": "20260831-4-1b683"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-4-1b683"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T23:58:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a 'Misaligned Form Field Mapping' issue in Mautic. Their form fields are incorrectly mapped, causing confusion, similar to our Salesforce data field misalignment. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/mautic/mautic/pull/335. Fiona, this might be helpful for your task.", "utterranceID": "20260831-5-17f3e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-5-17f3e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T00:01:00", "text": "Thanks, David! I'll look into the Mautic PR. It might offer some insights into resolving our UI misalignment. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260831-6-aa3dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-6-aa3dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T00:04:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these open-source examples in mind as we work through our issues. If you find anything particularly useful, share it with the team. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260831-7-f82fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-7-f82fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-f3ea48"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T00:05:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone else has insights or needs help, just let me know. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260831-8-fd402"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-8-fd402"}
