{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T03:37:00", "text": "Absolutely, David! The latency spike in Kafka is quite similar to what we're seeing with our Backend Optimization Engine. I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled it and see if we can apply any of their solutions. Thanks for pointing this out! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261202-2-d73b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-2-d73b9"}

