{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T12:59:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Parameter Storage' has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261226-0-994f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-0-994f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T13:03:00", "text": "The issue was due to improper memory management in the parameter storage module, which caused a gradual memory leak. This led to the optimization engine losing track of parameter updates over time.", "utterranceID": "20261226-1-6545e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-1-6545e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T13:07:00", "text": "I've submitted a fix that ensures proper deallocation of memory after each parameter update cycle. This prevents memory exhaustion and maintains the integrity of parameter history. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/48", "utterranceID": "20261226-2-5e8ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-2-5e8ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T13:11:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_6a0f49ba! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20261226-3-08037"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-3-08037"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T13:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20261226-4-37962"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-4-37962"}
