{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_839e5084", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:20:00", "text": "Hi team, I noticed that PR# 8 was approved and merged, but I've heard that the product direction has changed. Should we consider reverting this PR?", "utterranceID": "20260811-0-6e1c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-0-6e1c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01e37306", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:22:00", "text": "Hey @eid_839e5084, yes, the product team decided to pivot away from using GraphQL for now. We might need to discuss if reverting is the best course of action.", "utterranceID": "20260811-1-4c37a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-1-4c37a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:27:00", "text": "Hi everyone, I authored the PR. Can someone clarify the new direction and why the GraphQL server is no longer needed?", "utterranceID": "20260811-2-c4d67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-2-c4d67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_724e1180", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:28:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_86f94a48. The product team decided to stick with REST APIs for simplicity and to align with our existing infrastructure. GraphQL was seen as an unnecessary complexity at this stage.", "utterranceID": "20260811-3-52ba7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-3-52ba7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f3ea10f", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:29:00", "text": "From a QA perspective, reverting the PR would prevent us from having to test and maintain a feature that's not aligned with our current goals.", "utterranceID": "20260811-4-13b85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-4-13b85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:34:00", "text": "I agree with @eid_3f3ea10f. If the GraphQL server isn't going to be used, it makes sense to revert it to avoid confusion and maintenance overhead.", "utterranceID": "20260811-5-805f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-5-805f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:37:00", "text": "Does anyone see any potential issues with reverting the PR? Any dependencies or integrations that might be affected?", "utterranceID": "20260811-6-bd765"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-6-bd765"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_97d7392d", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T06:38:00", "text": "I don't think there are any dependencies yet since it was just set up. But we should double-check with the dev team to be sure.", "utterranceID": "20260811-7-dc0d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260811-7-dc0d9"}

