{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:02:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new PR for AI-powered suggestions. I found some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar features. Let's see what we can learn from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260926-0-7d8a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-0-7d8a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:07:00", "text": "First up, JupyterLab has a feature called AI-Driven Code Suggestions. It integrates AI to provide real-time code suggestions and improvements within the notebook environment. Check it out here: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/4924", "utterranceID": "20260926-1-29a71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-1-29a71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:08:00", "text": "That sounds pretty cool! Real-time code suggestions could really enhance user productivity. I think it aligns well with our goal of enhancing collaboration features. What do you think, @eid_a1fab288?", "utterranceID": "20260926-2-3a52b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-2-3a52b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:13:00", "text": "Absolutely, David! I like how it focuses on real-time interaction. It could be a great reference for our implementation. Maybe we can look into how they handle the AI model integration. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260926-3-37c9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-3-37c9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:15:00", "text": "Great points! Next, let's look at Apache Superset's Smart Visualization Recommendations. It uses AI to suggest optimal visualizations based on dataset characteristics and user queries. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/4925", "utterranceID": "20260926-4-ee562"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-4-ee562"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:19:00", "text": "Visualization recommendations are super useful, especially for users who might not be familiar with data visualization best practices. This could definitely inspire our approach to suggesting relevant data points. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260926-5-6291e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-5-6291e"}

