{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:28:00", "text": "I don't think there are any dependencies that would be affected. The integration was quite isolated, so reverting should be straightforward.", "utterranceID": "20261102-6-7fcc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-6-7fcc6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:33:00", "text": "Agreed. I haven't seen any issues that would arise from reverting. It seems like the best course of action given the circumstances.", "utterranceID": "20261102-7-6d2c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-7-6d2c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:36:00", "text": "Alright, it sounds like reverting is the consensus. @eid_724e1180, could you handle the revert for PR# 36?", "utterranceID": "20261102-8-ff721"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-8-ff721"}
