{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:20:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for developing API client libraries for popular languages: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/39. I've created libraries for Python, JavaScript, and Java. Each library includes easy-to-use interfaces for all API endpoints, along with documentation and tests for compatibility and performance. Looking forward to your feedback! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261104-0-526a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-0-526a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:25:00", "text": "Hey @eid_76d9cb07, thanks for sharing! I'll start reviewing it now. Excited to see how these libraries will make integration smoother for our users. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261104-1-1daf7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-1-1daf7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4d18a84c", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:30:00", "text": "Hi @eid_76d9cb07, I'll take a look as well. It's great to see support for multiple languages. Let's make sure everything's covered. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261104-2-cd6f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-2-cd6f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:33:00", "text": "I've gone through the Python and JavaScript libraries. The interfaces look intuitive, and the documentation is clear. However, I noticed the Java library is missing some usage examples in the documentation. Could you add those, @eid_76d9cb07?", "utterranceID": "20261104-3-b8c47"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-3-b8c47"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:36:00", "text": "Thanks for catching that, Hannah! I'll add the usage examples for the Java library. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261104-4-dfaf2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-4-dfaf2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4d18a84c", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:40:00", "text": "I also noticed that while the libraries are well-documented, the performance tests for the JavaScript library could be more comprehensive. It would be great to see some stress testing results to ensure it handles high loads effectively. What do you think, @eid_76d9cb07?", "utterranceID": "20261104-5-afcca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-5-afcca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:43:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. I'll work on adding more detailed performance tests for the JavaScript library. Thanks for the feedback! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261104-6-0035d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-6-0035d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:48:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan! Once those updates are in, we can take another look. Let us know if you need any help, @eid_76d9cb07. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261104-7-70991"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-7-70991"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4d18a84c", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:52:00", "text": "Absolutely, feel free to reach out if you need any assistance. Looking forward to the updates! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261104-8-6af5c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-8-6af5c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:55:00", "text": "Thanks, team! I'll make the necessary changes and ping you once they're ready for another review. Appreciate the feedback! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261104-9-5b140"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261104-9-5b140"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:27:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to start a discussion about our proposed PR for developing API client libraries. To guide our implementation, I've found some similar features from well-known open-source projects. Let's dive in and see what we can learn from them!", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-ebed7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-ebed7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:30:00", "text": "Sounds great, Bob! What do you have for us? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-1da43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-1da43"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch--daix-db3e57"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:37:00", "text": "Finally, ElasticSearch's PR 'GraphQL Query Language Support' adds support for GraphQL queries, enabling more flexible and efficient data retrieval. Here's the link: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/5103.", "utterranceID": "20260417-7-54110"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260417-7-54110"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch--daix-db3e57"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:38:00", "text": "ElasticSearch's support for GraphQL queries is a game-changer for data retrieval. The flexibility it offers could be a huge advantage for us. We should definitely explore how they structured their query language support. @eid_0f6b0aea, maybe you could look into this further?", "utterranceID": "20260417-8-f2b1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260417-8-f2b1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch--daix-db3e57"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:42:00", "text": "Sure thing, Julia! I'll dive deeper into ElasticSearch's implementation and see how we can incorporate some of their ideas. Thanks for the input, everyone! Let's keep the conversation going as we move forward with our implementation. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260417-9-fa3d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260417-9-fa3d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch--daix-db3e57"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T05:21:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for integrating GraphQL for data interactions: https://github.com/salesforce/dAIX/pull/1. This includes setting up a GraphQL server and defining schemas for data queries and mutations. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260420-0-30ba4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-0-30ba4"}
