{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:09:00", "text": "From a technical standpoint, the optimizations could still be beneficial if we decide to focus on GraphQL performance again. However, if the product direction has shifted, it might not be worth merging right now.", "utterranceID": "20261115-4-a48f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-4-a48f7"}
