{"title": "Develop Correction Capture System for AI Suggestions", "summary": "This PR adds functionality to capture user corrections to AI-generated suggestions. These corrections will be used to refine the AI model's future suggestions, enhancing its accuracy and relevance.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/15", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "15", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_a7dd9c52"}, "created_at": "2026-08-21T13:22:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_8cbee5b3"}, "comment": "The way user corrections are captured and stored looks solid. I tested a few scenarios, and everything seems to be logged correctly. The corrections are linked to the original suggestions with context maintained perfectly, which should help in refining the AI model. LGTM, approved! 🎉", "submitted_at": "2026-08-21T20:22:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_724e1180"}, "comment": "The differentiation between correction types is clear and well-implemented. The system correctly identifies data point changes and visualization adjustments. The user interface for submitting corrections is intuitive and user-friendly. Looks good to me too, approved! 🚀", "submitted_at": "2026-08-21T20:23:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_CollaborateForce_pull_15"}
