{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T08:00:00", "text": "Good point, Emma. Also, in the Security and Compliance section, we should specify how often the security audits are conducted. This could reassure stakeholders about our commitment to security. Maybe something like 'quarterly audits'?", "utterranceID": "20260807-2-ba857"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260807-2-ba857"}
