{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-06-23T11:12:00", "text": "First up, we have Apache Kafka's PR titled 'Security Audit and Vulnerability Assessment'. It focuses on enhancing the security posture of the Kafka ecosystem. You can check it out here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/2962", "utterranceID": "20260623-2-610a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-2-610a6"}

