{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:00:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Session Hijacking Vulnerability' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/38.", "utterranceID": "20270212-0-d5641"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-0-d5641"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:04:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_ecaa9084! Could you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270212-1-742c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-1-742c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:09:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was that session tokens were not being invalidated upon logout or after a certain period of inactivity. This made them vulnerable to reuse by attackers, allowing for session hijacking.", "utterranceID": "20270212-2-60233"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-2-60233"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:13:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270212-3-ea08e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-3-ea08e"}

