{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-20T21:06:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' issue in Redis. The inefficient caching mechanism is leading to increased database load and repeated queries, affecting performance. You can check out the PR here: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/1975. @eid_8d6fe78d, this might be relevant to the caching issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20270220-1-98fd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270220-1-98fd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-20T21:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll review the Redis PR to see if there are any strategies we can apply to our caching issue. It's always great to see how others are tackling similar problems! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270220-2-dfc7a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270220-2-dfc7a"}
