{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdb3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T22:20:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue in Redis titled 'Inefficient Caching Strategy'. The problem is with a suboptimal cache eviction policy leading to frequent cache misses, which increases latency in data retrieval. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/909. @eid_bac7c6c4, this seems quite similar to the caching issue you're working on. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261009-1-1d125"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261009-1-1d125"}
