{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T18:24:00", "text": "Sure, I'll make sure it stays unmerged. Thanks for the input, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260930-9-5a51d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-9-5a51d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_724e1180", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T14:44:00", "text": "Hi team, hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new PR to integrate feedback data into our AI model training pipeline. I've found some similar features in open-source projects that might give us some insights. Let's dive in!", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-29493"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-29493"}
