{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:14:00", "text": "First up, we have JupyterLab's [Interactive Data Visualization Widgets](https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/3310). They introduced React-based widgets to enhance interactivity within notebooks. This could be a great reference for making our components more engaging. What do you think, @eid_d0d918f1?", "utterranceID": "20260624-1-165dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-1-165dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:18:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This JupyterLab feature sounds promising. Their focus on interactivity aligns well with our goals. We should definitely consider how they handle data binding and user interaction. It might give us some ideas on improving user engagement in our dashboard. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260624-2-7c61a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-2-7c61a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:23:00", "text": "Agreed, Charlie. The way JupyterLab integrates React for dynamic visualization could be a game-changer for us. We should look into their component structure and see if we can adapt any patterns. @eid_fc0f17c3, maybe you could dive deeper into this?", "utterranceID": "20260624-3-2dd07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-3-2dd07"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T10:00:00", "text": "Thanks, @Alice Martinez and @Charlie Miller. I'll keep you posted if anything comes up during testing. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261026-7-6944b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-7-6944b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:30:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data representation in charts on the FlowForce dashboard has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20261028-0-f3163"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-0-f3163"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:32:00", "text": "The root cause was a mismatch in data type handling between our data processing backend and the visualization library. This caused the charts to display incorrect data points.", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-36dde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-36dde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:33:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the data processing logic to ensure consistent data types are used before passing data to the visualization library. This ensures accurate plotting of data points.", "utterranceID": "20261028-2-ac52e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-2-ac52e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:38:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_b6268ef7! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. Thanks for the quick turnaround.", "utterranceID": "20261028-3-09925"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-3-09925"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie Taylor! This should help prevent any misleading interpretations of our data. I'll inform the stakeholders about the fix.", "utterranceID": "20261028-4-99007"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-4-99007"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:48:00", "text": "Nice job, @eid_b6268ef7. I'll run some tests on the dashboard to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261028-5-4aadb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-5-4aadb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:50:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. I'll be around to help.", "utterranceID": "20261028-6-8cca2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-6-8cca2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:27:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with FlowForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261030-0-809db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-0-809db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:32:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Latency Reduction Feature Causes Increased API Response Time'. The latency reduction feature is actually increasing response times for some API calls. This is affecting the Performance Optimization & Routing Logic area and impacting customer CUST-0038. @eid_d098d618, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261030-1-60ebb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-1-60ebb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:36:00", "text": "Got it, I'll look into the latency issue and see what's causing the increased response times. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261030-2-6b337"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-2-6b337"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:41:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a UI issue: 'UI Freezes During High-Volume Data Visualization'. When users visualize large datasets, the dashboard becomes unresponsive. This affects the User Interface & Data Visualization Module and impacts customer CUST-0048. @eid_d098d618, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261030-3-60a06"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-3-60a06"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:46:00", "text": "Alright, I'll handle the UI freeze issue as well. I'll start by checking the data visualization module for any bottlenecks. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261030-4-b73e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-4-b73e3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71bfb0a9", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:14:00", "text": "On the UI front, we should definitely include a plan for a more intuitive layout and guided tutorials. This could be a new section under Training and Support, focusing on onboarding processes.", "utterranceID": "20260514-5-5ca97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-5-5ca97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4e8b2cdc", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:18:00", "text": "For documentation, we need to emphasize the creation of a centralized knowledge base. This should include comprehensive guides for integrating with less common third-party APIs.", "utterranceID": "20260514-6-f499e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-6-f499e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_610a4c21", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:22:00", "text": "Good point, @Hannah Taylor. We should also allocate resources for regular updates to this documentation to keep it current.", "utterranceID": "20260514-7-6a9ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-7-6a9ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:24:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll enhance the AI Engine section with more diverse training data and advanced configuration options, optimize the Real-Time Processing Modules for better latency management, improve the UI with intuitive layouts and tutorials, and create a centralized, regularly updated knowledge base for documentation. Let's assign these tasks and set a timeline for the updates. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260514-8-a0303"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-8-a0303"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T12:21:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_fforceaix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260516-0-303d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260516-0-303d1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261109-3-b0b35"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-3-b0b35"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:29:00", "text": "To resolve it, I adjusted the optimization parameters to ensure that the routing logic prioritizes the shortest path for API requests. I also added a validation step to catch any similar misconfigurations in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261109-4-d2694"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-4-d2694"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:34:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix, Ian. Thanks for jumping on this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261109-5-c9826"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-5-c9826"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:37:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work! Let us know if there's anything else we need to test on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261109-6-3ffae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-6-3ffae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:38:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Alice. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything should be back to normal.", "utterranceID": "20261109-7-23788"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-7-23788"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:10:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with FlowForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-ec2f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-ec2f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:13:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Data Aggregation in Summary Views'. The summary views in the FlowForce dashboard are displaying incorrect aggregated data. This is impacting the User Interface & Data Visualization Module and causing frustration for Customer CUST-0018. @eid_d098d618, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-e1bcc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-e1bcc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:15:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data aggregation issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261113-2-fdf4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-2-fdf4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:19:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Delayed Data Refresh in Real-Time Dashboards'. The real-time dashboards aren't updating promptly, which is also affecting the User Interface & Data Visualization Module. This is causing issues for Customer CUST-0007. @eid_d0d918f1, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261113-3-e2566"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-3-e2566"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:24:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the real-time dashboard refresh issue and see what's causing the delay. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261113-4-aa5de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-4-aa5de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:28:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Data Loss During High-Volume Transactions'. Some API flow data is being lost during synchronization under high transaction volumes. This affects the Database & Data Synchronization Module and is impacting Customer CUST-0038. @eid_d098d618, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261113-5-1a8c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-5-1a8c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:33:00", "text": "Understood, I'll handle the data loss issue as well. I'll make sure to prioritize both tasks and keep everyone updated. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261113-6-30008"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-6-30008"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:37:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's make sure to keep the customers updated on our progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional resources. Let's get these issues resolved! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261113-7-9dab1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-7-9dab1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:42:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_294ba09d. Let's get to work! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261113-8-2a1e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-8-2a1e2"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:26:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian! I'll take a closer look at their implementation and see what insights we can gather. Now, let's move on to Apache Superset's [React Component Library for Dashboards](https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/3311). They developed a set of reusable components to streamline dashboard creation. Julia, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260624-4-ebbb3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-4-ebbb3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:27:00", "text": "This is interesting! Superset's approach to creating a library of reusable components could really help us with maintainability and scalability. We should consider how they manage component state and props to ensure reusability. It might be worth exploring their library structure. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260624-5-a5546"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-5-a5546"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:29:00", "text": "Great point, Julia! Reusability is key for us too. I'll make a note to check out their component library in detail. Lastly, let's look at Grafana's [Dynamic Panel Rendering with React](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/3312). They implemented React components for flexible panel configurations. Charlie, how does this compare to our current setup?", "utterranceID": "20260624-6-29508"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-6-29508"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:32:00", "text": "Grafana's dynamic panel rendering is quite impressive. Their focus on flexibility and maintainability is something we should aim for. We might want to explore how they handle panel configurations and see if we can incorporate similar flexibility into our components. @eid_fc0f17c3, maybe you can add this to your list too?", "utterranceID": "20260624-7-11caf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-7-11caf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:35:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie! I'll investigate Grafana's approach as well. Thanks for the input, everyone! I'll compile my findings and we can discuss how to integrate these ideas into our project. Let's keep the momentum going! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260624-8-63a8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-8-63a8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T08:37:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for the new React components: https://github.com/salesforce/FForceAIX/pull/9. I've developed dynamic frontend components for the Analytics Dashboard. The goal is to ensure they're reusable and maintainable. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260628-0-c97bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-0-c97bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T08:39:00", "text": "@eid_fc0f17c3 Thanks for sharing, I'll take a look now! 👀", "utterranceID": "20260628-1-04f26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-1-04f26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T08:41:00", "text": "Hey @eid_fc0f17c3, I'll review it after lunch. Excited to see the new components in action! 🍴", "utterranceID": "20260628-2-7de74"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-2-7de74"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T08:42:00", "text": "Just started reviewing the PR, @eid_fc0f17c3. I'll focus on the reusability and best practices. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260628-3-25d93"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-3-25d93"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T08:44:00", "text": "Alright, I've gone through the PR. The components are well-integrated into the dashboard and follow React best practices. Great job on making them reusable! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260628-4-720c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-4-720c4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T08:46:00", "text": "I agree with Charlie. The components are responsive and perform well. The code is clean and easy to follow. LGTM, approved! ✅", "utterranceID": "20260628-5-db4fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-5-db4fe"}

