{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-14295c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7dfbbca2", "timestamp": "2026-05-10T09:00:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! It seems like there's a lot we can learn from these projects. I'll take a closer look at these features and see how we can adapt some of their strategies internally. Let's keep the ideas flowing! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260509-8-95e58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260509-8-95e58"}

