{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ghtAIX", "channelID": "ch-htaix-1ff460"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-03-24T20:20:00", "text": "Thanks, George! @eid_9f1ff493, I noticed that the 'Key Features' section mentions 'superior integration capabilities.' Could we specify which data systems we integrate with? This will help us identify any potential technical challenges early on. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260324-1-eb5e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260324-1-eb5e0"}
