{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T21:10:00", "text": "I adjusted the initialization sequence to ensure that the event listeners are fully established before any filter events can be triggered. This involved adding a synchronization mechanism to delay the event firing until the setup is complete.", "utterranceID": "20260903-4-77d7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-4-77d7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T21:14:00", "text": "Nice work, David! That sounds like a solid fix. I'll test it out on my end to make sure everything's working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20260903-5-cd711"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-5-cd711"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T21:16:00", "text": "Thanks, David. I'll also run some tests to verify. Appreciate the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20260903-6-c76c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-6-c76c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T21:20:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah and Fiona. Let me know if you encounter any issues. Otherwise, we should be good to go!", "utterranceID": "20260903-7-a40a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-7-a40a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:10:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Excessive Lock Contention' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/InsightForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20260910-0-79246"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-0-79246"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:13:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_63ea0ec4! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20260910-1-3485b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-1-3485b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:17:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was inefficient lock management strategies in the database layer. This led to excessive contention and bottlenecks during concurrent insight generation requests, especially during peak usage times.", "utterranceID": "20260910-2-eb82e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-2-eb82e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260910-3-39bac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-3-39bac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:22:00", "text": "We implemented a more granular lock mechanism and optimized the lock acquisition and release processes. This reduces the time each lock is held and minimizes contention. Additionally, we introduced a priority queue for lock requests to ensure critical operations are not delayed.", "utterranceID": "20260910-4-94f8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-4-94f8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:26:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid solution, Hannah. Thanks for tackling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20260910-5-c76ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-5-c76ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:29:00", "text": "Agreed, great work @eid_63ea0ec4! This should really help with our performance issues during peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260910-6-9ff7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-6-9ff7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:32:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David! Let me know if you notice any further issues or if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20260910-7-bc83f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-7-bc83f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T20:50:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with InsightForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261003-0-08aff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-0-08aff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T20:51:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inefficient Data Parsing Algorithm'. The backend processing engine isn't optimized for large datasets, causing increased processing times. This is impacting CUST-0016, leading to frustration during critical analysis periods. @eid_63ea0ec4, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261003-1-da288"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-1-da288"}

