{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobmiller-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c6eeee"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_44c67741", "timestamp": "2026-05-27T18:19:00", "text": "Awesome, Ian! Lastly, there's a Prometheus issue titled 'Incorrect Metric Sampling Rate'. The default sampling rate for metrics collection is set too low, leading to inaccurate data representation in performance graphs. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/pull/1657. Emma, this seems to align with our 'Sampling Rate Misconfiguration' issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260527-5-5d793"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260527-5-5d793"}
