{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-12T00:41:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's a 'Memory Leak in Parameter Storage' affecting the Backend Optimization Engine. This is causing decreased model accuracy for CUST-0084. @eid_6a0f49ba, could you also handle this one? 🧠", "utterranceID": "20261211-3-51379"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-3-51379"}
