{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-27T12:15:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was a flaw in the NLP engine's logic for detecting and handling negations. It was either overlooking or misinterpreting negation cues in user queries.", "utterranceID": "20270427-2-93eab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270427-2-93eab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-27T12:20:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_160fca3c. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270427-3-72f25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270427-3-72f25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-27T12:21:00", "text": "To resolve it, I updated the NLP engine to improve its negation detection algorithm. I added a more robust pattern recognition for common negation phrases and cues, and also implemented a context-aware parsing mechanism to better understand the intent behind the negations.", "utterranceID": "20270427-4-51201"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270427-4-51201"}
