{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidjohnson-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e101e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aedadd3e", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T22:08:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's leverage these insights and ensure our fixes are robust. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260923-9-a2b4b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-9-a2b4b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidjohnson-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e101e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ccdffb93", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:05:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect JWT token expiry management has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SupportForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20261002-0-9539b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-0-9539b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidjohnson-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e101e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ccdffb93", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:07:00", "text": "To recap, the issue was that our API gateway wasn't refreshing JWT tokens in time, which led to unexpected session expirations.", "utterranceID": "20261002-1-5d10d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-1-5d10d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidjohnson-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e101e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ccdffb93", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:12:00", "text": "The root cause was a flaw in the token refresh logic. Specifically, the refresh function was not being triggered until after the token had already expired.", "utterranceID": "20261002-2-b2f3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-2-b2f3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidjohnson-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e101e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ccdffb93", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T11:16:00", "text": "To fix this, I adjusted the logic to initiate the token refresh process earlier, based on a configurable threshold before the token's expiration time. This ensures tokens are renewed well before they expire.", "utterranceID": "20261002-3-e5c47"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-3-e5c47"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:49:00", "text": "I updated the configuration to align the token expiry settings with our intended duration. This involved adjusting the expiry parameter in the API Authentication Module to ensure tokens last as expected. I also added a unit test to verify the correct expiry duration moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20270208-4-2bf52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-4-2bf52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:51:00", "text": "Nice work, David! Adding a unit test is a great idea to prevent this from happening again.", "utterranceID": "20270208-5-9f9bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-5-9f9bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:54:00", "text": "Agreed, well done! Let’s monitor the system for a few days to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20270208-6-3bf89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-6-3bf89"}
