{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f731d34", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:18:00", "text": "Good point, Alice. Adding context awareness improvements will definitely help. We should also consider adding a feedback loop mechanism to continuously learn from user interactions. This could be a game-changer for improving AI accuracy over time. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261002-3-cff17"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-3-cff17"}
