{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_efc9418c", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:21:00", "text": "Great suggestions, George! We should also document API compatibility requirements more clearly. This will help third-party developers align with our system more effectively. 📚", "utterranceID": "20261002-5-6cfe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-5-6cfe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b34186ad", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:24:00", "text": "Regarding the slow performance issue, we should expand the 'Scalability' section to include more robust load balancing strategies. Additionally, optimizing query processing algorithms can significantly improve performance during peak times. @eid_5a940dab, do you have any insights?", "utterranceID": "20261002-6-fd9e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-6-fd9e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5a940dab", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma. We should also consider increasing server resources during peak times as a temporary measure while we work on long-term solutions. This can be mentioned under 'Performance Monitoring'. 📈", "utterranceID": "20261002-7-9d32b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-7-9d32b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5b61c55e", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:29:00", "text": "For customization difficulties, let's enhance the 'User Interface' section. We need to provide more flexible options for search parameter configuration and improve user training materials. This will empower users to tailor the search to their needs. @eid_aa99608e, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261002-8-6e1d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-8-6e1d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:34:00", "text": "I agree, Charlie. We should also gather more user feedback to understand specific customization needs better. This can be part of our continuous improvement process. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-5e3b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-5e3b2"}

