{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-edd459"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_961f0487", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T13:17:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in Parameter Adjustment Module' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/51.", "utterranceID": "20270127-0-85299"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-0-85299"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-edd459"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_961f0487", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T13:20:00", "text": "The root cause was that the parameter adjustment module lacked proper authentication and authorization checks on its endpoints, which allowed unauthorized users to manipulate model parameters.", "utterranceID": "20270127-1-cd0ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-1-cd0ea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-edd459"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_961f0487", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T13:22:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a robust authentication mechanism using OAuth 2.0 and added role-based access control to ensure only authorized users can access the endpoints.", "utterranceID": "20270127-2-ac2be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-2-ac2be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-edd459"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T13:25:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_961f0487! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. This will definitely enhance our security posture.", "utterranceID": "20270127-3-165ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-3-165ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-edd459"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_576f3f62", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T13:28:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! It's a relief to have this vulnerability patched up. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20270127-4-2799f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-4-2799f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-edd459"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ea95d983", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T13:32:00", "text": "Awesome job, Alice! Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side to verify the fix.", "utterranceID": "20270127-5-e658f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-5-e658f"}
