{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:15:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Insecure Parameter Storage Mechanism'.", "utterranceID": "20261125-0-e5b35"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-0-e5b35"}
