{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:10:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was that our NLP model wasn't properly accounting for negation phrases. This led to sentences like 'I don't dislike this project' being misclassified as negative.", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-f99d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-f99d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:13:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-5702c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-5702c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:15:00", "text": "We implemented a negation detection module that identifies negation phrases and adjusts the sentiment scoring accordingly. This involved updating our parsing logic to recognize common negation patterns and apply them before sentiment analysis.", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-145a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-145a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:17:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, @eid_6cc1a0f6!", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-9c56e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-9c56e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:20:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work, David. I'll run some tests to ensure everything's working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-a6a7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-a6a7e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:25:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20260829-7-ea6b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-7-ea6b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T03:56:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-d74dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-d74dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T03:57:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Sentiment Model Drift' issue. The sentiment analysis model on the backend server has drifted, causing inaccurate sentiment scores on the Real-Time Dashboard. This is impacting CUST-0003, and it's crucial for maintaining effective real-time monitoring. @eid_31cb6db5, this one's for you!", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-42144"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-42144"}
