{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c38fe0e7", "timestamp": "2026-08-01T20:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This is super relevant. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our issue. It's always helpful to see how others tackle similar challenges. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260801-2-8c06d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260801-2-8c06d"}
