{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:34:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Corruption in Customer Profiles' issue. Customer profiles are showing incorrect data, which affects the pitch generation. This is impacting Customer ID: CUST-0079. The problem lies in the Database Management & Data Synchronization area. @eid_a041a433, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270131-1-3514e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-1-3514e"}

