{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:22:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_2e1d6568! Could you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270228-1-36d59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-1-36d59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:23:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was an overly aggressive rate limiting configuration on our API gateway. It was set too low, which prevented complete data synchronization from external sources, leading to partial customer profiles.", "utterranceID": "20270228-2-906a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-2-906a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270228-3-32b73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-3-32b73"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:33:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues with PitchForce. Let's take a look! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-35f1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-35f1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:35:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in PostgreSQL titled 'Query Performance Degradation with Large Datasets'. It seems inefficient query execution plans are causing delays with large tables, similar to our 'Database Query Bottleneck'. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/384. @eid_0deececb, this might be useful for your work!", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-ca07c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-ca07c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:39:00", "text": "Thanks, George! I'll definitely check out the PostgreSQL PR. It might have some optimization strategies we can apply to our database queries. 🤓", "utterranceID": "20261210-2-51b06"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-2-51b06"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:43:00", "text": "Next, there's a React Native issue titled 'Touch Event Delay on Android Devices'. Users are experiencing lag in touch responsiveness, which sounds a lot like our 'Touch Input Lag on Mobile Devices'. Here's the PR: https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/385. Emma, this could be relevant for you!", "utterranceID": "20261210-3-1e28c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-3-1e28c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:44:00", "text": "Great find, George! I'll dive into the React Native PR and see if there are any solutions we can adapt for our mobile touch issues. 📱", "utterranceID": "20261210-4-00709"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-4-00709"}
