{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T20:21:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, @David Davis. Could you point out which discrepancies you're referring to? I'll make sure to address them.", "utterranceID": "20261101-5-52eee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-5-52eee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_73ca2844", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T20:25:00", "text": "Sure thing! On the dashboard page, the alignment of the header seems off compared to the design guidelines. Also, the sidebar menu doesn't collapse properly on smaller screens. 📱", "utterranceID": "20261101-6-5fd6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-6-5fd6a"}
