{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliagarcia-ProposalForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d166d6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8bab7c9d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T20:32:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new feature for a responsive UI in real-time collaboration. I've found some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar features. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270309-0-b13f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-0-b13f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliagarcia-ProposalForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d166d6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8bab7c9d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T20:37:00", "text": "First up, we have JupyterLab's 'Live Collaboration Sync'. This feature allows real-time synchronization for collaborative editing of notebooks. You can check it out here: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/2863. What do you think, @eid_a041a433?", "utterranceID": "20270309-1-788a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-1-788a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliagarcia-ProposalForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d166d6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T20:39:00", "text": "Thanks, George! This is pretty cool. JupyterLab's approach to real-time sync could definitely inform our implementation. I like how they handle conflict resolution. It might be worth looking into how they manage data consistency. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270309-2-50623"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-2-50623"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliagarcia-ProposalForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d166d6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_379522c3", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T20:41:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. The conflict resolution is key. We should consider how they handle simultaneous edits. It could be a game-changer for our user experience. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270309-3-bb2bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-3-bb2bf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T08:34:00", "text": "Finally, let's discuss ElasticSearch's Enhanced Query DSL for User Profiles. This PR expands the query DSL to support complex queries on user profile data, including nested and relational fields. Check it out here: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/3615. What do you think, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260903-7-f254f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-7-f254f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b2a9f4a", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T08:35:00", "text": "This is really relevant! The ability to handle complex queries could greatly enhance our GraphQL schema's flexibility. We should consider how we can incorporate similar capabilities to allow for more dynamic and powerful queries. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260903-8-0e596"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-8-0e596"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e0ce30d", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T08:37:00", "text": "Agreed, Charlie. Having a robust query system is essential for providing users with the data they need in a flexible manner. This could be a game-changer for our customer profile queries.", "utterranceID": "20260903-9-67b2e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-9-67b2e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T08:42:00", "text": "Awesome insights, team! I'll take a closer look at these features and see how we can adapt some of these ideas into our implementation. Thanks for the great discussion! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260903-10-0d39b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-10-0d39b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T13:20:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for the new GraphQL schema: https://github.com/salesforce/pAIX/pull/8. I've designed it to cover all necessary fields for customer profiles and support nested queries. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260907-0-0700b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-0-0700b"}
