{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b2a9f4a", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:19:00", "text": "Hey everyone, yes, the product team has decided to take a different approach, which might make this schema unnecessary. We should discuss if reverting is the best option.", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-a9344"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-a9344"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:23:00", "text": "Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and how it affects the GraphQL schema?", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-b4f3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-b4f3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e0ce30d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:25:00", "text": "The new direction focuses more on REST APIs for customer profiles instead of GraphQL, so this schema might not be needed anymore.", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-65700"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-65700"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:30:00", "text": "If we don't need the schema, reverting seems like the logical step. But are there any parts of the schema that could still be useful?", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-b7f91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-b7f91"}
