{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-998b7e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7fba1318", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T12:38:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about improper token validation in our API Gateway has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/InsightForce/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20260901-0-7faec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-0-7faec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-998b7e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T12:41:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_7fba1318! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20260901-1-b3710"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-1-b3710"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-998b7e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7fba1318", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T12:46:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The root cause was a flaw in the token validation logic. Specifically, the logic was incorrectly accepting expired or malformed tokens as valid, which allowed unauthorized users to access sensitive endpoints.", "utterranceID": "20260901-2-e1cea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-2-e1cea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-998b7e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T12:49:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona Davis. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260901-3-ceed6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-3-ceed6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-998b7e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7fba1318", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T12:50:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the validation logic to include stricter checks for token expiration and format. Additionally, I added unit tests to ensure that only properly formatted and non-expired tokens are accepted. This should prevent unauthorized access moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20260901-4-49592"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-4-49592"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-998b7e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T12:51:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_7fba1318! It's good to know that we have tests in place now. Thanks for handling this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20260901-5-cbba9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-5-cbba9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T01:27:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Feedback Data Exposure via Misconfigured Access Controls'. This is a security concern where feedback data is accessible to unauthorized users due to misconfigured access controls. It's affecting the Security Layer of Feedback Processing and could lead to data breaches. Impacted customer is CUST-0057.", "utterranceID": "20261213-4-e51f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-4-e51f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T01:28:00", "text": "This one is also for you, @eid_e9652ef0. Can you handle this as well?", "utterranceID": "20261213-5-16247"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-5-16247"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T01:33:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize the security issue and ensure we tighten those access controls. Security is key! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261213-6-e9fa1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-6-e9fa1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T01:36:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_e9652ef0! Lastly, we have 'Database Deadlock During Concurrent Feedback Processing'. This issue is causing database deadlocks when multiple feedback entries are processed simultaneously, affecting the Database Management System. It's slowing down updates to our AI models. Impacted customer is CUST-0087.", "utterranceID": "20261213-7-0efc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-7-0efc2"}
