{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T15:35:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Real-Time Data Integration Failure'. The AI model isn't integrating real-time updates, leading to outdated lead scores for CUST-0091. @eid_207da0e7, can you look into this?", "utterranceID": "20260917-5-882af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-5-882af"}
