{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data types in lead attributes has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/55.", "utterranceID": "20261115-0-814e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-0-814e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:48:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261115-1-292d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-1-292d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:51:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_3f4b2681. The root cause was a schema mismatch between the application layer and the database. Some fields were being cast to incorrect types during data insertion, which led to errors in our lead scoring algorithms.", "utterranceID": "20261115-2-c6531"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-2-c6531"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261115-3-3c371"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-3-3c371"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:56:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the data insertion logic to ensure that the fields are cast to the correct types. Additionally, I modified the database schema to enforce stricter type constraints, preventing similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261115-4-2a505"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-4-2a505"}
