{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:57:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data import process has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/56.", "utterranceID": "20261117-0-319f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-0-319f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:58:00", "text": "The root cause was a mapping error in our data import script. It was assigning external data fields to the wrong database columns, which led to erroneous data entries and flawed lead qualification.", "utterranceID": "20261117-1-40c40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-1-40c40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:02:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the mapping logic in the script to correctly align the external data fields with the appropriate database columns. I also added some unit tests to ensure this doesn't happen again.", "utterranceID": "20261117-2-c1176"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-2-c1176"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:07:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_652e8cd0! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261117-3-8500a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-3-8500a"}
