{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-03-22T09:05:00", "text": "Speed and efficiency are definitely strengths. Kudos to the previous team for setting such a solid foundation!", "utterranceID": "20260314-9-29f12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-9-29f12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_792330e0", "timestamp": "2026-03-22T09:10:00", "text": "Indeed, Ian. Let's make sure we continue to build on these strengths.", "utterranceID": "20260314-10-33366"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-10-33366"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-22T09:13:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice. We have a great base to work from. Excited for what's next!", "utterranceID": "20260314-11-d54bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-11-d54bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-03-24T23:56:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for dAIX is that some users are experiencing missed subtle trends in the trend identification algorithms. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0075.", "utterranceID": "20260314-0-94871"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-0-94871"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-25T00:01:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the current algorithm's capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260314-1-fc0cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-1-fc0cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-03-25T00:06:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. It could be that the algorithms aren't sophisticated enough to catch those subtle patterns. We might need to look into enhancing them.", "utterranceID": "20260314-2-52e70"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-2-52e70"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-25T00:07:00", "text": "@eid_7c6dd6a6, I agree. Another angle could be the data preprocessing. If it's not thorough, it might miss important features that help in trend detection.", "utterranceID": "20260314-3-31d03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-3-31d03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-03-25T00:12:00", "text": "Ian, that's a valid point. We should also consider if there are enough customization options for users to adjust the sensitivity of trend detection. That might help them catch those subtle trends.", "utterranceID": "20260314-4-99f26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-4-99f26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-25T00:17:00", "text": "Alice here. Maybe we should also look into how the data is being fed into the system. Insufficient or noisy data could be a factor too.", "utterranceID": "20260314-5-6c77c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-5-6c77c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-03-25T00:21:00", "text": "Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure we document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of dAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260314-6-eceab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260314-6-eceab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd4d2940", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T13:31:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the user interface complexity, performance inconsistencies, trend identification accuracy, integration limitations, and system reliability. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260327-0-f669c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-0-f669c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T13:33:24", "text": "@here Explore the Pandas library on GitHub, a powerful tool for data manipulation and analysis, crucial for identifying trends in large datasets. https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas", "utterranceID": "20260327-90-19a3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-90-19a3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T13:35:00", "text": "Hey @eid_bd4d2940, for the user interface section, I think we should emphasize the need for more user-friendly design principles and extensive user testing. The report currently states that the UI is intuitive, but feedback suggests otherwise. We might want to add a section on planned usability testing and design simplification.", "utterranceID": "20260327-1-11c09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-1-11c09"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:35:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was the algorithm's simplistic correlation model. It wasn't capturing the intricate interdependencies between multiple variables, which led to inaccurate anomaly detection.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-3859d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-3859d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:36:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, @eid_a8040636?", "utterranceID": "20260921-3-db8a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-3-db8a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:38:00", "text": "I updated the correlation model to incorporate a more sophisticated multivariate statistical approach. This allows it to better understand and account for complex interdependencies between variables.", "utterranceID": "20260921-4-07561"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-4-07561"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:40:00", "text": "Nice work, David Williams! This should improve our detection accuracy significantly.", "utterranceID": "20260921-5-1f4f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-5-1f4f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:42:00", "text": "Thanks, George Jones! Yes, the new model should enhance our anomaly detection capabilities. Let me know if you encounter any further issues.", "utterranceID": "20260921-6-88e55"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-6-88e55"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:44:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. I'll keep an eye on it during the next testing phase.", "utterranceID": "20260921-7-f7f9f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-7-f7f9f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T16:45:00", "text": "Thanks, David. I'll review the PR and run some tests on my end as well.", "utterranceID": "20260921-8-794ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-8-794ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:37:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect CORS configuration has been resolved. The API's CORS policy was overly permissive, allowing any origin to access our resources. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AnomalyForce/pull/32.", "utterranceID": "20260923-0-25a85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-0-25a85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:42:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_76d9cb07! Could you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20260923-1-646f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-1-646f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:47:00", "text": "Sure, George Garcia. The root cause was a wildcard (*) setting in the CORS policy, which didn't restrict access to trusted domains only. This misconfiguration could have led to unauthorized data access.", "utterranceID": "20260923-2-d38fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-2-d38fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:51:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David Miller. How did you fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260923-3-8d6a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-3-8d6a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:52:00", "text": "I updated the CORS policy to specify a list of trusted domains instead of using the wildcard. This ensures that only requests from these domains are allowed to access the API resources.", "utterranceID": "20260923-4-b515f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-4-b515f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:56:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_76d9cb07! This should definitely enhance our security posture.", "utterranceID": "20260923-5-5c07e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-5-5c07e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T08:57:00", "text": "Thanks, George Jones. If anyone has further questions or needs more details, feel free to reach out!", "utterranceID": "20260923-6-7bf05"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-6-7bf05"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T05:13:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with AnomalyForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261102-0-07692"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-0-07692"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T03:41:00", "text": "Great! Next, there's a 'Delayed State Update Feedback' issue in React. State updates in components are delayed, leading to inconsistent UI rendering and user confusion. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/843. David Martinez, this sounds a lot like our 'Delayed Parameter Update Feedback' issue. Thoughts? 🤓", "utterranceID": "20261202-3-1b6b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-3-1b6b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T03:45:00", "text": "Thanks, David! This React issue is definitely relevant. I'll review their approach to handling state updates and see if we can adapt any strategies for our UI feedback loop. Let's get this sorted for our users! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261202-4-b2010"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-4-b2010"}
