{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T01:37:00", "text": "Agreed, let us know if you need any additional testing or support. We've got your back! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270113-8-f9e39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270113-8-f9e39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T15:21:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect feature weighting has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20270114-0-02a1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-0-02a1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T15:23:00", "text": "The root cause was a bug in the feature importance calculation module. It was miscalculating feature weights, especially when new features were dynamically introduced.", "utterranceID": "20270114-1-109cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-1-109cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T15:26:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. Can you elaborate on how you fixed it?", "utterranceID": "20270114-2-49274"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-2-49274"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T15:30:00", "text": "Sure, David. I updated the calculation logic to correctly handle dynamic feature introductions. Specifically, I adjusted the algorithm to re-evaluate the entire feature set whenever a new feature is added, ensuring accurate weight distribution.", "utterranceID": "20270114-3-29cc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-3-29cc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T15:33:00", "text": "Great work, Fiona! Does this fix require any changes on our end for the upcoming release?", "utterranceID": "20270114-4-b8df3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-4-b8df3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T15:36:00", "text": "@eid_e81cfe3f No changes are needed on your end, David. The fix is backward compatible, so everything should work seamlessly with the current setup.", "utterranceID": "20270114-5-e64e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-5-e64e9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_15ac3a3b", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:54:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the buffer size and implemented a dynamic buffer allocation strategy. This should ensure that the buffer can expand as needed during high load periods.", "utterranceID": "20261127-2-05df3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-2-05df3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:56:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_15ac3a3b! This should help us get complete logs during those critical times.", "utterranceID": "20261127-3-85e9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-3-85e9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:58:00", "text": "Thanks, George! This was a tricky one. Glad to see it resolved.", "utterranceID": "20261127-4-ed4ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-4-ed4ed"}
