{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T23:40:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Unresponsive Control Sliders' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20261128-0-49c63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-0-49c63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T23:44:00", "text": "The issue was caused by a JavaScript event listener conflict. Specifically, the sliders were losing focus due to overlapping event handlers that were not properly managed.", "utterranceID": "20261128-1-5dbe5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-1-5dbe5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T23:47:00", "text": "To fix this, I refactored the event handling logic to ensure that the focus remains on the sliders when interacting with them. This involved consolidating the event listeners and adding a debounce function to manage rapid input changes.", "utterranceID": "20261128-2-0543d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-2-0543d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T23:51:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_67f8a879! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll test it out today.", "utterranceID": "20261128-3-4aa2e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-3-4aa2e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T23:55:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob Williams! This was a tricky one. Glad to see it resolved. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes.", "utterranceID": "20261128-4-8b280"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-4-8b280"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_15ac3a3b", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T00:00:00", "text": "Awesome job, Bob! Let me know if you need any help with further testing or deployment.", "utterranceID": "20261128-5-89eb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-5-89eb9"}
