{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T19:34:00", "text": "Got it, David. I'll start by reviewing the customer feedback and then coordinate with the UX team to explore possible adjustments. I'll keep everyone updated. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261118-6-20a2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-6-20a2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T19:38:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let us know if you need any help with testing once you have a fix in place. Good luck, Bob Williams! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261118-7-15623"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-7-15623"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:19:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with AutoTuneForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261122-0-82409"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-0-82409"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:20:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Unresponsive Control Sliders'. The control sliders for adjusting model parameters are becoming unresponsive intermittently. This affects the User Interface and is impacting Customer CUST-0090. @eid_67f8a879, this one's for you. Can you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20261122-1-f7f08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-1-f7f08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:21:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the UI to see what's causing the unresponsiveness. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261122-2-d0fb3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-2-d0fb3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:25:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Insecure Parameter Storage Mechanism'. Model parameters are being stored unencrypted, which is a security risk. This affects the Security Layer of the Parameter Adjustment Module and impacts Customer CUST-0019. @eid_9307fe85, can you handle this one?", "utterranceID": "20261122-3-19c5a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-3-19c5a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:20:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was a mismatch in time zone settings between the application server and the database server. This led to incorrect timestamp entries in the training logs.", "utterranceID": "20261119-2-bc029"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-2-bc029"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:21:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, George. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261119-3-25322"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-3-25322"}
