{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:36:00", "text": "I agree with Ian. Also, for the documentation issue, we should include a detailed user guide and tutorials in the vision document. This will help users understand the parameter adjustment process better. We can also simplify the process itself if possible. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260626-2-1fa67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-2-1fa67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:41:00", "text": "On the integration front, we need to expand our API support and ensure compatibility with more data sources. This should be reflected in the 'Integration' section of the document. We might also want to explore partnerships with third-party providers to enhance data diversity. 🔗", "utterranceID": "20260626-3-d1641"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-3-d1641"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:46:00", "text": "For the reliability issues, we should focus on improving our error handling and failover mechanisms. Adding a section on robust testing under high-load scenarios in the document could be beneficial. This will ensure we are prepared for real-time updates even under heavy data loads. ⚙️", "utterranceID": "20260626-4-58a05"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-4-58a05"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:51:00", "text": "Regarding the UI, we need to make it more intuitive. Perhaps adding user-friendly navigation and guidance features could help. We should also include plans for better onboarding resources in the document. This will reduce the learning curve for new users. 🎨", "utterranceID": "20260626-5-04217"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-5-04217"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:56:00", "text": "Great points, everyone. Let's ensure the document reflects these changes. We should also consider adding a 'User Feedback' section to continuously gather insights and improve the product. This will keep us aligned with user needs and expectations. 📈", "utterranceID": "20260626-6-4aaae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-6-4aaae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:59:00", "text": "Thanks for the input, team! Here's a summary of the key changes: \n1. Optimize algorithms for low-power systems and update system requirements.\n2. Enhance documentation with detailed guides and tutorials.\n3. Expand API support and explore third-party partnerships.\n4. Improve error handling and testing for high-load scenarios.\n5. Make the UI more intuitive with better onboarding resources.\n6. Add a 'User Feedback' section.\n\nI'll draft the updates and share them for review. Let's aim to finalize this by the end of the week. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260626-7-b1a17"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-7-b1a17"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T23:00:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_atf_aix_product_vision_document|Product Vision Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260627-0-d2ee7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-0-d2ee7"}
