{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T20:38:00", "text": "I agree with George Jones, the scheduling part is well done. However, I noticed that the retraining process doesn't seem to fully incorporate the latest user interaction data. It looks like some of the data sources are not being updated correctly. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261129-4-c1bf0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-4-c1bf0"}
