{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8436fc1f", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T07:03:00", "text": "Perfect timing! I'll dive into their fix and see if there's anything we can leverage for our image rendering issue. Thanks for the heads-up, Emma G! 🖼️", "utterranceID": "20260925-4-f2935"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-4-f2935"}
