{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:15:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for 'Implement User Interaction Tracking for Model Refinement'. Here's the link: https://github.com/salesforce/extAIX/pull/11. I've developed a system to track and log user interactions with our analytics insights. This data will help refine our models and improve the relevance and accuracy of the insights. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-0-dce09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-0-dce09"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:17:00", "text": "Thanks for sharing, @eid_ecaa9084! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see how this will enhance our model refinement process. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261114-1-c4ab2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-1-c4ab2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:22:00", "text": "Hey @eid_ecaa9084, I'll review it too. Tracking user interactions sounds like a great step forward. Let's see how it all fits together. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261114-2-15f99"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-2-15f99"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:26:00", "text": "I've gone through the PR, and it looks like the user interactions are being tracked and logged accurately. Great job on that front, @eid_ecaa9084! 👏", "utterranceID": "20261114-3-36033"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-3-36033"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:29:00", "text": "I agree with Alice, the tracking seems solid. However, I noticed that the interaction data format might need some adjustments to be more suitable for model training. It seems a bit too verbose, which could complicate the preprocessing steps. What do you think, @eid_ecaa9084?", "utterranceID": "20261114-4-e8741"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-4-e8741"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:33:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, Bob! I can see how the verbosity might be an issue. I'll look into optimizing the data format to make it more streamlined for model training. Any specific suggestions on how to improve it?", "utterranceID": "20261114-5-8a9e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-5-8a9e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:37:00", "text": "Also, I noticed a slight dip in performance when the tracking system is active. We might need to optimize that part to ensure it doesn't impact the user experience. Maybe some caching or asynchronous processing could help? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261114-6-a4895"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-6-a4895"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:40:00", "text": "Good catch, Alice. I'll investigate the performance impact and see if we can implement some optimizations. Thanks for pointing that out! I'll make these changes and update the PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-7-9c83c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-7-9c83c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:45:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan, @eid_ecaa9084. Looking forward to the updates. Let us know if you need any help with the optimizations. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261114-8-766a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-8-766a7"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:52:00", "text": "First up, there's a concurrency bottleneck in the PostgreSQL query planner. Similar to our ContextForce issue, queries are being executed sequentially, which increases response times under heavy load. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/1951. @George, this might give us some insights for optimizing our query execution.", "utterranceID": "20261231-1-28226"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-1-28226"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll review the PostgreSQL PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our concurrency issue. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261231-2-6ab40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-2-6ab40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:54:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a bug in TensorFlow related to model overfitting on limited datasets. This is quite similar to our AI model issue where it's overfitting to a narrow set of user behaviors. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1952. George, since you're already on the AI model, this might be useful for you too.", "utterranceID": "20261231-3-83853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-3-83853"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:56:00", "text": "Perfect timing! I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR and see how they tackled the overfitting problem. Let's make our AI insights more robust! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261231-4-db0ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-4-db0ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:01:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks George! Lastly, there's a high latency issue in Grafana's dashboard data fetching, which is causing delays similar to what we're seeing with our API calls. Here's the PR: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1953. @Alice, this might be relevant for the latency issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20261231-5-83fd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-5-83fd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:05:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll check out the Grafana PR and see if there are any optimizations we can apply to reduce our API latency. Let's get those insights flowing smoothly again! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261231-6-91d98"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-6-91d98"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:06:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep learning from these open-source projects and apply what we can to our own issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261231-7-acd10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-7-acd10"}
