{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:24:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270105-0-8f665"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-0-8f665"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:27:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Scope Assignment'. Third-party applications are unable to access certain insights due to incorrect scope assignments during the authentication process. This affects the API Authentication Module and is impacting customer CUST-0017. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270105-1-0c741"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-1-0c741"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:17:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a mechanism to invalidate session tokens immediately upon user logout and introduced a timeout feature that automatically invalidates tokens after 15 minutes of inactivity. This should prevent any unauthorized reuse of session tokens.", "utterranceID": "20270212-4-22ecb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-4-22ecb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:21:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_ecaa9084! That sounds like a solid fix. Is there anything else we need to do on our end?", "utterranceID": "20270212-5-68968"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-5-68968"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:26:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia. Just make sure to pull the latest changes and test the session management thoroughly in your respective environments. Let me know if you encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20270212-6-53c55"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-6-53c55"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:31:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for the heads up, Julia. I'll start testing right away.", "utterranceID": "20270212-7-de210"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-7-de210"}
