{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T21:45:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the time-series data analysis and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270131-2-ddd62"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-2-ddd62"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T21:47:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_8d6fe78d! Next, we have 'Data Aggregation Discrepancies'. There are inconsistencies in data aggregation leading to conflicting insights in reports. This also affects the Report Generation & Data Processing area and impacts customer CUST-0006. @eid_88c661bc, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270131-3-31599"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-3-31599"}
