{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T21:55:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks @eid_88c661bc! Lastly, we have a 'Security Vulnerability in User Data Handling'. Sensitive user data is exposed due to improper encryption during data transmission. This is a critical issue affecting the Data Transmission & Security Layer and impacts customer CUST-0025. @eid_8d6fe78d, can you handle this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20270131-5-4a249"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-5-4a249"}
