{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:25:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect AI model behavior titled 'Preference Model Drift' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20270313-0-40dae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-0-40dae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:26:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_92c62291! Can you explain what caused the drift?", "utterranceID": "20270313-1-54cdf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-1-54cdf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:27:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The root cause was that the AI model hadn't been retrained with recent data. Over time, this led to a drift in its understanding of user preferences, causing it to misinterpret behaviors.", "utterranceID": "20270313-2-5e6aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-2-5e6aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270313-3-c03b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-3-c03b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:31:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I retrained the model using the latest dataset, which realigned its parameters with current user preferences. Additionally, I've set up a schedule for regular retraining to prevent future drifts.", "utterranceID": "20270313-4-be9dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-4-be9dd"}
